    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Brush G J, Dana E S (1878) On a new and remarkable mineral locality in Fairfield County, Connecticut; with a description of several new species occurring there. First Paper., American Journal of Science and Arts 16, 33-46; 114-123</gsmin:statusnotes>
