    <gsmin:rruffids>R061133 | R120012</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Olenite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Olenite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Sokolov P B, Gorskaya M G, Gordienko V V, Petrova M G, Kretser Y L, Frank-Kamenetskii V A (1986) Olenite Na1-xAl3Al6B3Si6O27(O,OH)4—a new high-alumina mineral of the tourmaline group, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 115, issue 1, 119-123 Jambor J L, Grew E S, Puziewics J, Vanko D A (1988) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 73, 439-445 Chemical formula revised: Cempírek J, Novák M, Ertl A, Hughes J M, Rossman G R, Dyar D M (2006) Fe-bearing olenite with tetrahedrally coordinated Al from an abyssal pegmatite at Kutná Hora, Czech Republic: structure, crystal chemistry, optical and XANES spectra, The Canadian Mineralogist 44, 23-30</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Tourmaline</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.CK.05</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Cyclosilicate: [Si6O18]12- 6-membered single rings, with insular complex anions</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Olenite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1985-006</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
