    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Parakuzmenkoite-Fe</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chukanov N V, Pekov I V, Semenov E I, Zadov A E, Krivovichev S V, Berns P C (2001) Parakuzmenkoite-Fe, (K,Ba)2Fe(Ti,Nb)4[Si4O12]2(O,OH)4·7H2O - a new labuntsovite group mineral, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 130, issue 6, 63-67 Jambor J L, Roberts A C (2002) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 87, 1731-1735</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Labuntsovite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.CE.30g</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
