    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">(NH&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;9&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(SO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·4H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imanumber xml:lang="en">IMA2015-014</gsmin:imanumber>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">(N&lt;sup&gt;3-&lt;/sup&gt;H&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;9&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(S&lt;sup&gt;6+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;](OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·4H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Huizingite-(Al)</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Huizingite-(Al)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Kampf A R, Richards R P, Nash B P, Murowchick J B, Rakovan J F (2016) Carlsonite, (NH_4_)_5_Fe^3+^_3_O(SO_4_)_6_·7H_2_O, and huizingite-(Al), (NH_4_)_9_Al_3_(SO_4_)_8_(OH)_2_·4H_2_O, two new minerals from a natural fire in an oil-bearing shale near Milan, Ohio. American Mineralogist 101, 2095-2107</gsmin:statusnotes>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/earlandite">
