    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Nishio-Hamane D, Tanaka T, Minakawa T (2018) Aurihydrargyrumite, a natural Au_6_Hg_5_ phase from Japan. Minerals 8, 415</gsmin:statusnotes>
