    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Described by Connell: Connell A (1847) On sulphato-chloride of copper, a new mineral, The Edinburgh New Philosophical Journal 43, 243-244 Named by Dana: Dana J D (1850) Connellite, in System of Mineralogy, Third Edition, George P Putnam (New York and London) 523-523</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Connellite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
