    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Chukanov N V, Kulikova I M, Zubkova N V, Krotova O D, Sorokina N I, Pushcharovskii D Y (2004) New mineral bario-olgite, Ba(Na,Sr,REE)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Na[PO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;]&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; and its crystal structure, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 133(1), 41-49</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Aphthitalite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
