    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Perhamite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Perhamite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Dunn P J, Appleman D E (1977) Perhamite, a new calcium aluminum silico-phosphate mineral, and a re-examination of viséite, Mineralogical Magazine 41, 437-442 Fleischer M, Pabst A, White J S (1978) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 63, 793-796</gsmin:statusnotes>
