    <gsmin:handbookofmineralogyurl>http://www.handbookofmineralogy.com/pdfs/clinoptilolitena.pdf</gsmin:handbookofmineralogyurl>
    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Na&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;30&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;)O&lt;sub&gt;72&lt;/sub&gt;·20H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:mindatid>min-6884</gsmin:mindatid>
    <gsmin:mindaturi rdf:resource="https://www.mindat.org/1:1:6884:6"/>
    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-6884.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Na&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;30&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;)O&lt;sub&gt;72&lt;/sub&gt;·20H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffids>R061099</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Clinoptilolite-Na</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Clinoptilolite-Na</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mineral is described but not named: Sheppard R A, Gude A J (1969) Diagenesis of tuffs in the Barstow Formation, Mud Hills, San Bernardino County, California, U.S. Geological Survey Professional Paper 634, 1-14 Name defined for the Na dominant phase: Coombs D S, Alberti A, Armbruster T, Artioli G, Colella C, Galli E, Grice J D, Liebau F, Mandarino J A, Minato H, Nickel E H, Passaglia E, Peacor D R, Quartieri S, Rinaldi R, Ross M, Sheppard R A, Tillmanns E, Vezzalini G, (1997) Recommended nomenclature for zeolite minerals: report of the subcommittee on zeolites of the international mineralogical association, commission on new minerals and mineral names, The Canadian Mineralogist 35, 1571-1606</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.GE.05</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Zeolite family: Chains of T10O20 Tetrahedra</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Clinoptilolite-Na.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1969</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/calcjarlite">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Calcjarlite</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geology/Mineral_Material"/>
    <gsmin:chemistryelements>Na | Ca | Mg | Al | F | O | H</gsmin:chemistryelements>
    <gsmin:fleischersgroup xml:lang="en">jarlite</gsmin:fleischersgroup>
    <gsmin:handbookofmineralogyurl>http://www.handbookofmineralogy.com/pdfs/calcjarlite.pdf</gsmin:handbookofmineralogyurl>
    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Na&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Ca,&lt;span style="border: 1px solid #333; font-size:7px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;14&lt;/sub&gt;(Mg,&lt;span style="border: 1px solid #333; font-size:7px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;12&lt;/sub&gt;F&lt;sub&gt;64&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:mindatid>min-861</gsmin:mindatid>
    <gsmin:mindaturi rdf:resource="https://www.mindat.org/1:1:861:9"/>
    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-861.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">NaCa&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;F&lt;sub&gt;16&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Calcjarlite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Calcjarlite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Described a calcium dominant jarlite: Nozhkin A D, Moleva V A, Chubkova T P (1970) First find of jarlite in the U.S.S.R., Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 99, 458-462 New mineral species recognized and named: Povarennykh A S (1973) On the new mineral species calcjarlite, Konstitutsiya i Svoistva Mineralov 7, 131-135</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Jarlite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>03.CC.20</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Soro-aluminofluoride</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Calcjarlite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1970</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/calkinsite-ce">
