    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Cochromite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Cochromite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">DeWaal S A (1978) Nickel minerals from Barberton, South Africa. VIII. The spinels cochromite and nichromite, and their significance to the origin of the Bon Accord nickel deposit, Bulletin du Bureau de Recherches Géologiques et Minières 1978, 225-230</gsmin:statusnotes>
