    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Paseroite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Paseroite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mills S J, Bindi L, Cadoni M, Kampf A R, Ciriotti M E, Ferraris G (2012) Paseroite, PbMn&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;(Mn&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;,Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(V&lt;sup&gt;5+&lt;/sup&gt;,Ti,Fe&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;,-)&lt;sub&gt;18&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;38&lt;/sub&gt;, a new member of the crichtonite group, European Journal of Mineralogy 24, 1061-106</gsmin:statusnotes>
