    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Natalyite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Reznitskii L Z, Skliarov E V, Ushchapovskaia Z F (1985) Natalyite Na(V,Cr)Si2O6—a new chromium-vanadium pyroxene from Slyudianka, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 114, issue 5, 630-635 Hawthorne F C, Bladh K W, Burke E A J, Grew E S, Langley R H, Puciewicz J, Roberts A C, Schedler R A, Vanko D A (1987) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 72, 222-230</gsmin:statusnotes>
