    <dct:source xml:lang="en">CGI faulttype SKOS vocabulary 2016-10-19</dct:source>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Fault that dips at least 45 degrees over more than half of the recognized extent of the fault with the hanging wall displaced from a structurally higher position relative to footwall rocks.</rdfs:comment>
