    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Boralsilite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Grew E S, McGee J J, Yates M G, Peacor D R, Rouse R C, Huijsmans J P P, Shearer C K, Weidenbeck M, Thost D E, Su S (1998) Boralsilite (Al&lt;sub&gt;16&lt;/sub&gt;B&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;37&lt;/sub&gt;): a new mineral related to sillimanite from pegmatites in granulite-facies rocks, American Mineralogist 83, 638-651</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.BD.30</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Sorosilicate: Si2O7 groups, with additional anions; cations in tetrahedral [4] and greater coordination</gsmin:strunzlabel>
