    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Nitromagnesite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Known previous to obtaining a formal mineral name: Rome de l'Isle J B L (1783) Nitre de magnésie, in Cristallographie, ou Description des Formes a Tous les Corps du Regne Minéral, Volume 1, (Paris) 361-362 Mineral was named in this publication: Shepard C U (1835) Nitro-magnesite. Magnesian earthy-salt, in Treatise on Mineralogy: Second Part, Volume II, Hezekiah Howe &amp; Co. (New Haven) 85-85</gsmin:statusnotes>
