  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geologicfault/Fault_Separation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">a vector (magnitude and orientation) specifying the distance between the intersection of a surface on opposite sides of a displacment surface. In 3-D is the projection of a vector normal to the displaced surface into the displacment surface, but might also be specified as offset of the intersection of displacement surface and marker surface in some other profile view (e.g. horizontal/map view, or a cross section)</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Separation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/common/Physical_Quality"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="n487acc5da05049618fd9508bab26ad38b12"/>
  </rdf:Description>
