    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Davidlloydite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Hawthorne F C, Cooper M A, Abdu Y A, Ball N A, Back M E, Tait K T (2012) Davidlloydite, ideally Zn&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(AsO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;, a new arsenate mineral from the Tsumeb mine, Otjikoto (Oshikoto) region, Namibia: description and crystal structure, Mineralogical Magazine 76, 45-57</gsmin:statusnotes>
