    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Harada K, Honda M, Nagashima K, Kanisawa S (1976) Masutomilite, manganese analogue of zinnwaldite, with special reference to masutomilite-lepidolite-zinnwaldite series, Mineralogical Journal 8, 95-109 Fleischer M, Cabri L J, Nickel E H, Pabst A (1977) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 62, 593-600 Chemical fomrula redefined: Brigatti M F, Mottana A, Malferrari D, Cibin G (2007) Crystal structure and chemical composition of Li-, Fe-, and Mn-rich micas, American Mineralogist 92, 1395-1400</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Mica</gsmin:structuralgroup>
