    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Milton C, Ingram B, Clark J R, Dwornik E J (1965) Mckelveyite, a new hydrous sodium barium rare-earth uranium carbonate mineral from the Green River Formation, Wyoming, American Mineralogist 50, 593-612 Name changed from mckelveyite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>05.CC.05</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Carbonate without additional anions, with H2O, With rare earth elements (REE)</gsmin:strunzlabel>
