    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Eirikite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">The mineral is named but not described: Grice J D (2008) Be-silicates: New minerals, structure topologies, classification and uses, Geochimica et Cosmochimica Acta 72, A329-A329 Mineral described in this publication: Larsen A O, Kolitsch U, Gault R A, Giester G (2010) Eirikite, a new mineral species of the leifite group from the Langesundsfjord district, Norway, European Journal of Mineralogy 22, 875-880</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Leifite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.EH.25</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
