    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Paramontroseite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Paramontroseite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Evans H T, Mrose M E (1955) A crystal study of montroseite and paramontroseite, American Mineralogist 40, 861-875</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Ramsdellite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>04.DB.15a</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Oxide, Metal: Oxygen = 1:2 and similar, With medium-sized cations; chains of edge-sharing octahedra</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Paramontroseite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1955</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/fluorapophyllite-k">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Fluorapophyllite-(K)</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geology/Mineral_Material"/>
    <gsmin:chemistryelements>K | Ca | Si | O | F | H</gsmin:chemistryelements>
    <gsmin:crystalsystem xml:lang="en">tetragonal</gsmin:crystalsystem>
    <gsmin:fleischersgroup xml:lang="en">apophyllite</gsmin:fleischersgroup>
    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">KCa&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;20&lt;/sub&gt;F·8H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imanumber xml:lang="en">IMA1978 s.p.</gsmin:imanumber>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved|Renamed</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">KCa&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;20&lt;/sub&gt;F·8H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffids>R040095 | R050021 | R050084 | R060554</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Fluorapophyllite-(K)</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Fluorapophyllite-(K)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Lucas J A H (1806) XIII Espèce. Apophyllite, in Tableau Méthodique des Espèces Minérales, Première Partie, Chez Levrault (Paris) 266-268 Renamed as the F-dominant species of apophyllite: Dunn P J, Wilson W E (1978) Nomenclature revisions in the apophyllite group: hydroxyapophyllite apophyllite fluorapophyllite, The Mineralogical Record 9, 95-98 Name changed from fluorapophyllite to apophyllite-(KF): Burke E A J (2008) Tidying up mineral names: an IMA-CNMNC scheme for suffixes, hyphens and diacritical marks, The Mineralogical Record 39, 131-135 Name changed from apophyllite-(KF): Hatert F, Mills S J, Pasero M, Williams P A (2013) CNMNC guidelines for the use of suffixes and prefixes in mineral nomenclature, and for the preservation of historical names. European Journal of Mineralogy 25, 113-115</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Apophyllite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/hugelite">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Hügelite</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geology/Mineral_Material"/>
    <gsmin:chemistryelements>Pb | U | O | As | H</gsmin:chemistryelements>
    <gsmin:crystalsystem xml:lang="en">monoclinic</gsmin:crystalsystem>
    <gsmin:fleischersgroup xml:lang="en">phosphuranylite</gsmin:fleischersgroup>
    <gsmin:handbookofmineralogyurl>http://www.handbookofmineralogy.com/pdfs/hugelite.pdf</gsmin:handbookofmineralogyurl>
    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Pb&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(UO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(AsO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·5H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved|Grandfathered</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:mindatid>min-1942</gsmin:mindatid>
    <gsmin:mindaturi rdf:resource="https://www.mindat.org/1:1:1942:8"/>
    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-1942.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Pb&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(U&lt;sup&gt;6+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(As&lt;sup&gt;5+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·5H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Hügelite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Hugelite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Dürrfeld V (1913) Über Krystalle eines wasserhaltigen Blei-Zink-Vanadinats von Reichenbach bei Lahr (Schwarzwald). Zeitschrift für Krystallographie und Mineralogie 51, 278-279 Chemical composition revised: Walenta K, Wimmenauer W (1961) Der Mineralbestand des Michaelganges im Weiler bei Lahr (Schwarzwald). Jahreshefte des Geologischen Landesamtes in Baden-Württemberg 4, 7-37</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>08.EC.15</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Uranyl phosphate or arsenate, UO2:RO4 = 3:2</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Hugelite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1913</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/arsenuranylite">
