    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mills S J, Groat L A, Wilson S A, Birch W D, Whitfield P S, Raudsepp M (2008) Angastonite, CaMgAl&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(PO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;·7H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O: a new phosphate mineral from Angaston, South Australia, Mineralogical Magazine 72, 1011-1020</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>08.DL.25</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Phosphate, etc. with additional anions and H2O, With large and medium-sized cations, (OH, etc.):RO4 = 2:1</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://webmineral.com/data/Angastonite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>2008-008</gsmin:wikipediadate>
