    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Tazheranite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Konev A A, Ushchapovskaya Z F, Kashaev A A, Lebedeva V S (1969) Tazheranite, a new calcium-titanium-zirconium mineral, Doklady Akademii Nauk SSSR 186, 917-920 Chamical formula revised: Rastsvetaeva R K, Pushcharovskii D Yu, Spiridonov E M, Gekimyants V M (1998) Tazheranite and calzirtite: structural-mineralogical similarity and distinction, Doklady Akademii Nauk 359, issue 4, 529-531</gsmin:statusnotes>
