    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Khomyakov A P, Korobitsyn M F, Kurova T A, Cherepivskaya G E (1987) Grumantite NaHSi_2_O_5_·H_2_O - a new mineral, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 116(2), 244-248</gsmin:statusnotes>
