    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Petterdite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Birch W D, Kolitsch U, Witzke T, Nasdala L, Bottrill R S (2000) Petterdite, the Cr-dominant analogue of dundasite, a new mineral species from Dundas, Tasmania, Australia and Callenberg, Saxony, Germany, The Canadian Mineralogist 38, 1467-1476</gsmin:statusnotes>
