    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Passaglia E (1969) Roggianite, a new silicate mineral, Clay Minerals 8, 107-111 Fleischer M (1969) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 54, 1737-1742 Chemical formula redefined: Passaglia E, Vezzalini G (1988) Roggianite: revised chemical formula and zeolitic properties, Mineralogical Magazine 52, 201-206 Chemical formula redefined again: Giuseppetti G, Mazzi F, Tadini C, Galli E (1991) The revised crystal structure of roggianite: Ca2[Be(OH)2Al2Si4O13]&lt;2.5(H2O), Neues Jahrbuch für Mineralogie, Monatshefte 1991, 307-314</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.GB.20</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Zeolite family: Chains of single connected 4-membered rings</gsmin:strunzlabel>
