    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Eremenko G E, Bel´ko V A (1982) Khanneshite, (Na,Ca)_3_(Ba,Sr,RE,Ca)_3_(CO_3_)_5_, a new mineral of the burbankite group, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 111(3), 321-324</gsmin:statusnotes>
