    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Bobjonesite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Schindler M, Hawthorne F C, Huminicki D M C, Haynes P, Grice J D, Evans H T (2003) Bobjonesite, V&lt;sup&gt;4+&lt;/sup&gt;O(SO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)(H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;, a new mineral species from Temple Mountain, Emery County, Utah, U.S.A., The Canadian Mineralogist 41, 83-90</gsmin:statusnotes>
