    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Milton C, Appleman D E, Appleman M H, Chao E C T, Cuttita F, Dinnin J I, Dwornik E J, Ingram B L, Rose H J (1976) Merumite, a complex assemblage of chromium minerals from Guyana, U.S. Geological Survey Professional Paper 887, 1-29</gsmin:statusnotes>
