  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/oxystibiomicrolite">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Oxystibiomicrolite</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geology/Mineral_Material"/>
    <gsmin:chemistryelements>Sb | Ca | Ta | O</gsmin:chemistryelements>
    <gsmin:crystalsystem xml:lang="en">cubic</gsmin:crystalsystem>
    <gsmin:fleischersgroup xml:lang="en">pyrochlore-microlite subgroup</gsmin:fleischersgroup>
    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">(Sb&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;,Ca)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Ta&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved|Redefined</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:mindatid>min-3738</gsmin:mindatid>
    <gsmin:mindaturi rdf:resource="https://www.mindat.org/1:1:3738:5"/>
    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-3738.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">(Sb&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;,Ca)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Ta&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Oxystibiomicrolite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Oxystibiomicrolite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Originally named stibio-microlite: Foshag W F (1938) New Mineral Names, American Mineralogist 23, 541-542 Mineral discredited: Fleischer M (1942) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 27, 465-466 Reinstated as a valid species: Jambor J L, Burke E A J, Ercit T S, Grice J D (1988) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 73, 1492-1499 Name changed from stibiomicrolite, and redefined: Atencio D, Andrade M B, Christy A G, Gieré R, Kartashov P M (2010) The pyrochlore supergroup of minerals: nomenclature, The Canadian Mineralogist 48, 673-698</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Pyrochlore-microlite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>04.??</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Oxide, hydroxide or arsenite</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Stibiomicrolite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1938</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/ruarsite">
