    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Achavalite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Olsacher J (1939) Achavalita, seleniuro de hierro. Nueva especie mineral, Boletin de la Facultad de Ciencias Exactas, Fisicas y Naturales, Universidad Nacional de Cordoba 2, 73-78 Spelling of name changed from achavalite to achávalite: Hålenius U, Hatert F, Pasero M, Mills S J (2015) IMA Commission on New Minerals, Nomenclature and Classification (CNMNC) Newsletter 28. New minerals and nomenclature modifications approved in 2015. Mineralogical Magazine 79, 1859-1864</gsmin:statusnotes>
