    <gsmin:rruffids>R070364</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Blixite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Blixite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Gabrielson O, Parwel A, Wickman F E (1958) Blixite, a new lead-oxyhalide mineral from Långban, Arkiv för Mineralogi och Geologi 2, 411-415 Chemical formula revised from Pb&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;ClO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH): Krivovichev S V, Burns P C (2006) The crystal structure of Pb&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;5&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Cl&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;, a synthetic analogue of blixite?, The Canadian Mineralogist 44, 515-522</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>03.DC.50</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Double-, Oxy- or Hydroxy-  halide with Pb (As,Sb,Bi), without Cu</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Blixite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1960</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
