    <gsmin:mindaturi rdf:resource="https://www.mindat.org/1:1:3699:9"/>
    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-3699.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Na&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;(Na&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Ca)(NaCaMn&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;)Na&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Ti&lt;sup&gt;4+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Na&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Ti&lt;sup&gt;4+&lt;/sup&gt;Mn&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;)(Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(PO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OF)F&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Sobolevite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Sobolevite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Khomyakov A P, Kurova T A, Chistyakova N (1983) Sobolevite Na_14_Ca_2_MnTi_3_P_4_Si_4_O_34_ - a new mineral. Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 112, 456-461 Chemical formula revised: Sokolova E, Hawthorne F C, Khomyakov A P (2005) Polyphite and sobolevite: revision of their crystal structures, The Canadian Mineralogist 43, 1527-1544</gsmin:statusnotes>
