    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chukanov V Y, Moiseev M M, Pekov I V, Lazebnik K A, Rastsvetaeva R K, Zayakina N V, Ferraris G, Ivaldi G (2004) Nabalamprophyllite Ba(Na,Ba){Na&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;Ti[Ti&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;14&lt;/sub&gt;](OH,F)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;} - a new layer titanosilicate of the lamprophyllite group from Inagli and Kovdor alkaline-ultramafic massifs, Russia, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 133(1), 59-72</gsmin:statusnotes>
