    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Ruthenarsenite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Harris D C (1974) Ruthenarsenite and iridarsenite, two new minerals from the territory of Papua and New Guinea and associated irarsite, laurite and cubic iron-bearing platinum, The Canadian Mineralogist 12, 280-284 Fleischer M, Pabst A, Mandarino J A, Chao G Y, Cabri L J (1976) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 61, 174-186</gsmin:statusnotes>
