    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Cerite-(La)</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Cerite-(La)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pakhomovsky Y A, Men’shikov Y P, Yakovenchuk V N, Ivanyuk G Y, Krivovichev S V, Burns P C (2002) Cerite-(La), (La, Ce, Ca)&lt;sub&gt;9&lt;/sub&gt;(Fe,Ca,Mg)(SiO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;[SiO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)]&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;, a new mineral species from the Khibina alkaline massif: Occurrence and crystal structure, The Canadian Mineralogist 40, 1177-1184</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Whitlockite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.AG.20</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Nesosilicate with additional anions; cations in &gt; [6] +- [6] coordination</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Cerite-%28La%29.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>2001-042</gsmin:wikipediadate>
