    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Tranquillityite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Lovering J F, Wark D A, Reid A F, Ware N G, Keil K, Prinz M, Bunch T E, El Goresy A, Ramdohr P, Brown G M, Peckett A, Phillips R, Cameron E N, Douglas J A V, Plant A G (1971) Tranquillityite: a new silicate mineral from Apollo 11 and Apollo 12 basaltic rocks, Proceedings of the Second Lunar Science Conference 1, 39-45</gsmin:statusnotes>
