    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Ferraris G, Ivaldi G, Chopin C (1995) Magnesiodumortierite, a new mineral from very-high-pressure rocks (Western Alps). Part I: Crystal structure, European Journal of Mineralogy 7, 167-174 Chemical formula changed from (Mg,Ti)(Al,Mg)_2_Al_4_BSi_3_(O,OH)_18_: Pieczka A, Evans R J, Grew E S, Groat L A, Ma C, Rossman G R (2013) The dumortierite supergroup. I. A new nomenclature for the dumortierite and holtite groups. Mineralogical Magazine 77, 2825-2839</gsmin:statusnotes>
