    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Friis H, Balic-Žunic T, Pekov I V, Petersen O V (2004) Kuannersuite-(Ce), Ba_6_Na_2_REE_2_(PO_4_)_6_FCl, a new member of the apatite group, from the Ilímaussaq alkaline complex, South Greenland: description and crystal chemistry, The Canadian Mineralogist 42, 95-106 Chemical formula revised: Pasero M, Kampf A R, Ferraris C, Pekov I V, Rakovan J R, White T J (2010) Nomenclature of the apatite supergroup minerals, European Journal of Mineralogy 22, 163-179</gsmin:statusnotes>
