    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Cafetite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Kukharenko A A, Kondrat´Eva V V, Kovyazina V M (1959) Cafetite, a new hydrous titanate of calcium and iron, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 88, 444-453 Chemical formula revised: Krivovichev S V, Yakovenchuk V N, Burns P C, Pakhomovsky Y A, Menshikov Y P (2003) Cafetite, Ca[Ti&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;5&lt;/sub&gt;](H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O): Crystal structure and revision of chemical formula, American Mineralogist 88, 424-429</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>04.FL.75</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
