    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Thenardite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Casaseca J L (1826) Thenardite, The Annals of Philosophy 12, 312-314 Name changed from thenardite to thénardite : Williams P A, Hatert F, Pasero M, Mills S J (2014) IMA Commission on new minerals, nomenclature and classification (CNMNC) Newsletter 20. New minerals and nomenclature modifications approved in 2014. Mineralogical Magazine 78, 549-558</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>07.AC.25</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Sulfate, selenate, etc. without additional anions, without H2O, With medium-sized and large cations</gsmin:strunzlabel>
