    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Keller V P, Hess H, Dunn P J (1981) Bartelkeit, PbFe^2+^Ge_3_O_8_, ein neues Germanium-Mineral von Tsumeb, Namibia. Chemie der Erde 40, 201-206 Chemical formula revised from PbFe^2+^Ge_3_O_8_ to PbFeGe&lt;sup&gt;VI&lt;/sup&gt;(Ge&lt;sup&gt;IV&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;)(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O: Origlieri M J, Yang H, Downs R T, Posner E S, Domanik K J, Pinch W W (2012) The crystal structure of bartelkeite, with a revised chemical formula, PbFeGe&lt;sup&gt;VI&lt;/sup&gt;(Ge&lt;sup&gt;IV&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;)(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, isotypic with high-pressure P2_1_/m lawsonite, American Mineralogist 97, 1812-1815</gsmin:statusnotes>
