    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Borodin L S, Kazakova M E (1954) Belovite - a new mineral from an alkaline pegmatite, Doklady Akademii Nauk SSSR 96, 613-616 Chemical formula redefined: Pekov I V, Chukanov N V, Beletskaya O V, Khomyakov A P, Menshikov Y P (1995) Belovite-(Ce): New data, refined formula and relationship to other minerals of the apatite group, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 124, 98-110</gsmin:statusnotes>
