    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Men´shikov Y P (1984) Denisovite Ca&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(K&lt;sub&gt;1.4&lt;/sub&gt;Na&lt;sub&gt;0.6&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;16&lt;/sub&gt;(F,OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; - a new mineral from the Khibina massif, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 113(6), 718-723</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.HA.85</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
