    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Hatert F, Roda-Robles E, de Parseval P, Wouters J (2012) Zavalíaite, (Mn^2+^,Fe^2+^,Mg)_3_(PO_4_)_2_, a new member of the sarcopside group from La Empleada pegmatite, San Luis Province, Argentina, The Canadian Mineralogist 50, 1445-1452</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Olivine-Sarcopside</gsmin:structuralgroup>
