    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Smith M L, Frondel C (1968) The related layered minerals ganophyllite, bannisterite, and stilpnomelane, Mineralogical Magazine 36, 893-913 Chemical formula revised: Dunn P J, Leavens P B, Norberg J A, Ramik R A (1981) Bannisterite: new chemical data and empirical formulae, American Mineralogist 66, 1063-1067</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Clay</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.EG.75</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Phyllosilicate: Double nets with 6-membered and larger rings</gsmin:strunzlabel>
