    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Orlandi, P, Moëlo Y, Meerschaut A, Palvadeau P, Leone P (2004) Lead-antimony sulfosalts from Tuscany (Italy). VI. Pellouxite ~ (Cu,Ag)2Pb21Sb23S55ClO, a new oxo-chloro-sulfosalt from Buca della Vena mine, Apuan Alps, European Journal of Mineralogy 16, 839-844 Piilonen P C, Grew E S, Ercit T S (2005) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 90, 1227-1233</gsmin:statusnotes>
