    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Zelenski M E, Zubkova N V, Ksenofontov D A, Kabalov Y K, Chukanov N V, Yapaskurt V O, Zadov A E, Pushcharovsky D Y (2012) Krasheninnikovite, KNa&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;CaMg(SO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;F, a new mineral from the Tolbachik volcano, Kamchatka, Russia, American Mineralogist 97, 1788-1795</gsmin:statusnotes>
