    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Mutnovskite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Zelenski M, Balic-Žunic T, Bindi L, Garavelli A, Makovicky E, Pinto D, Vurro F (2006) First occurrence of iodine in natural sulfosalts: The case of mutnovskite, Pb_2_AsS_3_(I,Cl,Br), a new mineral from the Mutnovsky volcano, Kamchatka Peninsula, Russian Federation, American Mineralogist 91, 21-28</gsmin:statusnotes>
