    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Rock in which plagioclase feldspar has been converted to sericite, an informal term for  fine-grained white phyllosilicate minerals. Commonly associated with phyllic altered rocks, used to describe less intense alteration.</rdfs:comment>
