    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Alumoakermanite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Wiedenmann D, Zaitsev A N, Britvin S N, Krivovichev S V, Keller J (2009) Alumoåkermanite, (Ca,Na)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Al,Mg,Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;)(Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;), a new mineral from the active carbonatite-nephelinite-phonolite volcano Oldoinyo Lengai, northern Tanzania, Mineralogical Magazine 73, 373-384</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Melilite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.BB.10</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Sorosilicate: Si2O7 groups, without non-tetrahedral anions; cations in tetrahedral [4] and greater coordination</gsmin:strunzlabel>
