    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-3749.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Sn&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Ta&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Oxystannomicrolite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Oxystannomicrolite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Originally named sukulaite: Fleischer M (1968) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 53, 2103-2106 Name replaces sukulaite: Hogarth D D (1977) Classification and nomenclature of the pyrochlore group, American Mineralogist 62, 403-410 Name changed from stannomicrolite and mineral redefined: Atencio D, Andrade M B, Christy A G, Gieré R, Kartashov P M (2010) The pyrochlore supergroup of minerals: nomenclature, The Canadian Mineralogist 48, 673-698</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Pyrochlore-microlite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
