    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Chukanov N V, Kononkova N N, Belakovsky D I, Pushcharovsky D Y, Vinogradova S A (1998) Ferronordite-(Ce) Na_3_SrFeSi_6_O_17_ and manganonordite-(Ce) Na_3_SrMnSi_6_O_17_ - the new minerals from Lovozero massif, Kola Peninsula, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 127(1), 32-41</gsmin:statusnotes>
