    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Cuprobismutite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Cuprobismutite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mineral described but not named: Hillebrand W F (1884) On an interesting variety of löllingite and other minerals, The American Journal of Science 27, 343-358 Mineral is named: Dana E S (1892) Cuprobismutite, in The System of Mineralogy, John Wiley &amp; Sons (New York) 110-111</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>02.JA.10a</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
