    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Biraite-(Ce)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Konev A, Pasero M, Pushcharovsky D, Merlino S, Kashaev A, Suvorova L, Ushchapovskaya Z, Nartova N, Lebedeva Y, Chukanov N (2005) Biraite-(Ce), Ce&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;(CO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;)(Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;), a new mineral from Siberia with a novel structure type, European Journal of Mineralogy 17, 715-721</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.BE.90</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
