    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">CuAl&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;[AsO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;]&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;(H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved|Renamed</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:iupacchemname xml:lang="en">IUPAC: Dicopper heptaaluminium tetraarsenate tridecahydroxyl 11.5hydrate</gsmin:iupacchemname>
    <gsmin:mindatid>min-933</gsmin:mindatid>
    <gsmin:mindaturi rdf:resource="https://www.mindat.org/1:1:933:5"/>
    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-933.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Cu&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;[As&lt;sup&gt;5+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;]&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;(H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffids>R060261</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Ceruleite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Ceruleite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Dufet M H (1900) Sur une nouvelle espèce minérale, la céruléite, Bulletin de la Société Française de Minéralogie 23, 147-150 Chemical formula revised: Schmetzer K, Berdesinski W, Bank H, Kroužek E (1976) Neue untersuchungen an ceruleite, Neues Jahrbuch für Mineralogie, Monatshefte 1976, 418-425 Chemical formula revised from Cu_2_Al_7_(AsO_4_)_4_(OH)_13_·11.5H_2_O: Mills S J, Christy A G, Favreau G (2018) The crystal structure of ceruleite, CuAl_4_[AsO_4_]_2_(OH)_8_(H_2_O)_4_, from Cap Garonne, France. Mineralogical Magazine 82, 181-187</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>08.DE.25</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Phosphate, etc. with additional anions and H2O, With only medium-sized cations, (OH, etc.):RO4 = 3:1</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Ceruleite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1900</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/rambergite">
