    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Ferrihydrite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Ferrihydrite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chukhrov F V, Zvyagin B B, Gorshkov A I, Yermilova L P, Balashova V V (1973) Ferrihydrite, Izvestiya Akademii Nauk SSSR 1973, 23-33 Chemical formula redefined: Michel F M, Ehm L, Antao S M, Lee P L, Chupas P J, Liu G, Strongin D R, Schoonen M A A, Phillips B L, Parise J B (2007) The structure of ferrihydrite, a nanocrystalline material, Science 316, 1726-1729 Chemical formula redefined again: Paktunc D, Manceau A, Dutrizac J (2013) Incorporation of Ge in ferrihydrite: Implications for the structure of ferrihydrite. American Mineralogist 98, 848-858</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Nolanite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>04.FE.35</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
