    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Jambor J L, Roberts A C, Owens D R, Grice J D (1996) Zajacite-(Ce), a new rare-earth fluoride from the Strange Lake deposit, Quebec-Labrador, The Canadian Mineralogist 34, 1299-1304 Name changed from zajacite-(Ce) to gagarinite-(Ce), and chemical formula revised to show ordered Ca and Ce: Sciberras M J, Leverett P, Williams P A, Hibbs D E, Roberts A C, Grice J D (2011) The single-crystal X-ray structure of gagarinite-(Ce). The Canadian Mineralogist 49, 1111-1114</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Gagarinite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
