    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Paderaite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mumme W G, Žák L (1985) Paderaite, Cu5.9Ag1.3Pb1.6Bi11.2S22, a new mineral of the cuprobismutite-hodrushite group, Neues Jahrbuch für Mineralogie, Monatshefte 1985, 557-567 Hawthorne F C, Bladh K W, Burke E A J, Grew E S, Langley R H, Puciewicz J, Roberts A C, Schedler R A, Vanko D A (1987) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 72, 222-230 Chemical formula revised: Topa D, Makovicky E (2006) The crystal structure of paderaite, Cu7(X0.33Pb1.33Bi11.33)S13S22, with X = Cu or Ag: new data and interpretation, The Canadian Mineralogist 44, 481-495</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>02.JA.10e</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">PbS type sulfosalt with  little or no Pb</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Paderaite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1983-091</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/rockmaterial/Quartz_Syenite">
