    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mineral described but not named in this paper: Shannon E V (1920) Boulangerite, bismutoplagionite, naumannite and a silver-bearing variety of jamesonite, Proceedings of the United States National Museum 58, 589-607 Mineral named in this report: Wherry E T (1921) New minerals, American Mineralogist 6, 82-83</gsmin:statusnotes>
