    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Shepard C U (1846) On three new mineral species from Arkansas, and the discovery of the diamond in North Carolina, The American Journal of Science and Arts 52, 249-254 chemical formula changed from Ca_3_(Ti^4+^,Fe^3+^)_2_[(Si,Fe^3+^)O_4_]_3_: Grew E S, Locock A J, Mills S J, Galuskina I O, Galuskin E V, Hålenius U (2013) Nomenclature of the garnet supergroup. American Mineralogist 98, 785-811</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Garnet</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.AD.25</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
