    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Moore P B, Irving A J, Kampf A R (1975) Foggite, CaAl(OH)_2_(H_2_O)[PO_4_]; goedkinite, (Sr,Ca)_2_Al(OH)[PO_4_]_2_; and samuelsonite (Ca,Ba)Fe^2+^_2_Mn^2+^_2_Ca_8_Al_2_(OH)_2_[PO_4_]_10_: Three new species from the Palermo No. 1 Pegmatite, North Groton, New Hampshire, American Mineralogist 60, 957-964</gsmin:statusnotes>
