    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Magnesio-foitite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Hawthorne F C, Selway J B, Kato A, Matsubara S, Shimizu M, Grice J D, Vajdak J (1999) Magnesiofoitite, [box](Mg_2_Al)Al_6_(Si_6_O_18_)(BO_3_)_3_(OH)_4_, a new alkali-deficient tourmaline, The Canadian Mineralogist 37, 1439-1443 Name changed from magnesiofoitite: Henry D J, Novák M, Hawthorne F C, Ertl A, Dutrow B L, Uher P, Pezzotta F (2011) Nomenclature of the tourmaline-supergroup minerals, American Mineralogist 96, 895-913</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Tourmaline</gsmin:structuralgroup>
  </rdf:Description>
