    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Natrotantite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Natrotantite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Voloshin A V, Men’shikov Y P, Pakhomovskii Y A (1981) Alumotantite and natrotantite, new tantalum minerals in granitic pegmatites, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 110, issue 3, 338-345 Fleischer M, Burns R G, Cabri L J, Francis C A, Pabst A (1982) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 67, 413-418</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>04.DJ.05</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Oxide, Metal: Oxygen = 1:2 and similar, With large (+- medium-sized) cations; polyhedral frameworks</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Natrotantite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1980-026</gsmin:wikipediadate>
