    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">The mineral was known before this publication, but under other names, such as mispickel: Glocker E F (1847) Ordo VI. Pyritae. Pyrite. III. Pyritae arsenopyritoidei. 10. Arsenopyrites., in Generum et Specierum Mineralium, Secundum Ordines Naturales Digestorum Synopsis, Apud Eduardum Anton 34-43</gsmin:statusnotes>
