    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Vochten R, Deliens M, Medenbach O (2001) Oswaldpeetersite, (UO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;CO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·4H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, a new basic uranyl carbonate mineral from the Jomac Urandium Mine, San Juan County, Utah, U.S.A., The Canadian Mineralogist 39, 1685-1689</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>05.EA.20</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Uranyl Carbonate, UO2:CO3 &gt; 1:1</gsmin:strunzlabel>
