    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Ferraris G, Franchini-Angela M, Orlandi P (1978) Canavesite, a new carbonate mineral from Brosso, Italy, The Canadian Mineralogist 16, 69-73</gsmin:statusnotes>
