    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Johansson K (1924) Bidrag till Gladhammar-gruvornas mineralogi, Arkiv för Kemi, Mineralogi och Geologi 9, 1-22 Chemical formula revised: Topa D, Makovicky E, Balic-Žunic T (2002) The structural role of excess Cu and Pb in gladite and krupkaite based on new refinements of their structure, The Canadian Mineralogist 40, 1147-1159</gsmin:statusnotes>
