    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chen Z, Luo K, Tan F, Zhang Y, Gu X (1986) Tengchongite, a new mineral of hydrated calcium uranyl molybdate, Kexue Tongbao 31, 396-401</gsmin:statusnotes>
