    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Callegari A M, Boiocchi M, Bellatreccia F, Caprilli E, Medenbach O, Cavallo A (2011) Capranicaite, (K,[box])(Ca,Na)Al&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;B&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;18&lt;/sub&gt;: a new inosilicate from Capranica, Italy, with a peculiar topology of the periodic single chain [Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;], Mineralogical Magazine 75, 33-43</gsmin:statusnotes>
