    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Perttunen V (1970) Lokkaite, a new hydrous RE-carbonate from Pyörönmaa pegmatite in Kangasala, SW-Finland, Bulletin of the Geological Society of Finland 43, 67-72 Formula changed: Nagashima K, Miyawaki R, Takase J, Nakai I, Sakurai K, Matsubara S, Kato A, Iwano S (1986) Kimuraite, CaY_2_(CO_3_)_4_·6H_2_O, a new mineral from fissures in an alkali olivine basalt from Saga Prefecture, Japan, and new data on lokkaite. American Mineralogist 71, 1028-1033 Name changed from lokkaite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042</gsmin:statusnotes>
