    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Haring M M M, McDonald A M (2017) Charleshatchettite, CaNb_4_O_10_(OH)_2_·8H_2_O, a new mineral from Mont Saint-Hilaire, Québec, Canada: Description, crystal-structure determination, and origin. American Mineralogist 102, 2333-2340</gsmin:statusnotes>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/proustite">
