    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Ni&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;(U&lt;sup&gt;6+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(As&lt;sup&gt;5+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·10H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Rauchite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Rauchite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Levitskiy V V, Krivovichev S V, Zolotarev A A, Bryzgalov I A, Zadov A E, Chukanov N V (2012) New nickel-uranium-arsenic mineral species from the oxidation zone of the Belorechenskoye deposit, Northern Caucasus, Russia: I. Rauchite, Ni(UO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(AsO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·10H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, a member of the autunite group, European Journal of Mineralogy 24, 913-922</gsmin:statusnotes>
