    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Jambor J L, Boyle R W (1962) Gunningite, a new zinc sulphate from the Keno Hill – Galena Hill area, Yukon, The Canadian Mineralogist 7, 209-218</gsmin:statusnotes>
