    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pautov L A, Agakhanov A A, Sokolova E, Hawthorne F C (2004) Maleevite, BaB&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;, and pekovite, SrB&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;, new mineral species from the Dara-I-Pioz Alkaline Massif, northern Tajikistan: description and crystal structure, The Canadian Mineralogist 42, 107-119</gsmin:statusnotes>
