    <dct:source xml:lang="en">LeMaitre et al. 2002</dct:source>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Phaneritic crystalline igneous rock consisting of quartz, alkali feldspar and/or plagioclase. Includes rocks defined modally in QAPF fields 2, 3, 4 and 5 as alkali feldspar granite, granite, granodiorite or tonalite.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">granitoid</rdfs:label>
