    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Cooper M A, Hawthorne F C, Moffatt E (2009) Steverustite, Pb2+5(OH)5[Cu+(S6+O3S2-)3](H2O)2, a new thiosulphate mineral from the Frongoch mine dump, Devils Bridge, Ceredigion, Wales: description and crystal structure, Mineralogical Magazine 73, 235-250</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>07.JA.10</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Thiosulfate of Pb</gsmin:strunzlabel>
