    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Kampf A R, Roberts A C, Venance K E, Carbone C, Belmonte D, Dunning G E, Walstrom R E (2013) Cerchiaraite-(Fe) and cerchiaraite-(Al), two new barium cyclosilicate chlorides from Italy and California, USA, Mineralogical Magazine 77, 69-80</gsmin:statusnotes>
