    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Global Standard Stratigraphic Age: a geological time date defined by the International Stratigraphic Commission, based on assertion of a time point and loosely (weakly) affiliated with some rock body related to e.g. age date(s) or a field observation(s).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">add SHACL rule that GSSA may not have property Simple_Uncertainty</rdfs:comment>
