    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Nishio-Hamane D, Minakawa T, Ohgoshi Y (2013) Takanawaite-(Y), a new mineral of the M-type polymorph with Y(Ta,Nb)O_4_ from Takanawa Mountain, Ehime Prefecture, Japan. Journal of Mineralogical and Petrological Sciences 108, 335-344</gsmin:statusnotes>
