    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Plášil J, Sejkora J, Cejka J, Novák M, Viñals J, Ondruš P, Veselovský F, Škácha P, Jehlicka J, Goliáš V, Hloušek J (2010) Metarauchite, Ni(UO_2_)_2_(AsO_4_)_2_·8H_2_O, from Jáchymov, Czech Republic, and Schneeberg, Germany: A new member of the autunite group, The Canadian Mineralogist 48, 335-350</gsmin:statusnotes>
