    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Jeanbandyite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Kampf A R (1982) Jeanbandyite a new member of the stottite group from Llallagua, Bolivia, The Mineralogical Record 13, 235-239 Chemical formula revised from (Fe^3+^,Mn^2+^,Fe^2+^)(Sn^4+^,[box])(OH)_6_: Welch M D, Kampf A R (2017) Stoichiometric partially-protonated states in hydroxide perovskites: the jeanbandyite enigma revisited. Mineralogical Magazine 81, 297-303</gsmin:statusnotes>
