    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Škoda R, Plášil J, Copjaková R, Novák M, Jonsson E, Galiová M V, Holtstam D (2018) Gadolinite-(Nd), a new member of the gadolinite supergroup from Fe-REE deposits of Bastnäs-type, Sweden. Mineralogical Magazine 82, S133-S145</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Gadolinite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
