    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Manganoquadratite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Bonazzi P, Keutsch F N, Bindi L (2012) Manganoquadratite, AgMnAsS&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;, a new manganese-bearing sulfosalt from the Uchucchacua polymetallic deposit, Lima Department, Peru: Description and crystal structure, American Mineralogist 97, 1199-1205</gsmin:statusnotes>
