    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Foord E E, Martin R F, Fitzpatrick J J, Taggart J E, Crock J G (1991) Boromuscovite, a new member of the mica group, from the Little Three mine pegmatite, Ramona district, San Diego County, California, American Mineralogist 76, 1998-2002</gsmin:statusnotes>
