    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Moore P B, Kampf A R, Irving A J (1974) Whitmoreite, Fe^2+^Fe^3+^_2_(OH)_2_(H_2_O)_4_[PO_4_]_2_, a new species: its description and atomic arrangement, American Mineralogist 59, 900-905</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Arthurite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
