    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Brögger W C (1893) VIII. Sundtit, ein neues Mineral von Oruro in Bolivia, Zeitschrift für Kristallographie 21, 193-199 Name changed to indicate the andorite phase with multiple of 4 units along its c-axis: Donnay J D H, Donnay G (1954) Syntaxic intergrowths in the andorite series, American Mineralogist 39, 161-171 Chemical formula changed from Ag_15_Pb_18_Sb_47_S_96_: Nespolo M, Ozawa T, Kawasaki Y, Sugiyama K (2012) Structural relations and pseudosymmetries in the andorite homologous series, Journal of Mineralogical and Petrological Sciences 107, 226-243</gsmin:statusnotes>
