    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Chukanov N V, Kononkova N N, Zadov A E, Belovitskaya Y V (2000) Remondite-(La), Na_3_(La,Ce,Ca)_3_(CO_3_)_5_ - a new mineral of the burbankite family from Khibiny massif, Kola Peninsula, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 129(1), 53-60 Spelling of name changed from remondite-(La) to rémondite-(La): Hålenius U, Hatert F, Pasero M, Mills S J (2015) IMA Commission on New Minerals, Nomenclature and Classification (CNMNC) Newsletter 28. New minerals and nomenclature modifications approved in 2015. Mineralogical Magazine 79, 1859-1864</gsmin:statusnotes>
