    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Oxyphlogopite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chukanov N V, Mukhanova A A, Rastsvetaeva R K, Belakovskiy D I, Möckel S, Karimova O V, Britvin S N, Krivovichev S V (2010) Oxyphlogopite K(Mg,Ti,Fe)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;[(Si,Al)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;10&lt;/sub&gt;](O,F)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;, a new mica group mineral, Zapiski Rossiiskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchetstva 139(3), 31-40</gsmin:statusnotes>
