    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Yang H, Jenkins R A, Thompson R M, Downs R T, Evans S H, Bloch E M (2012) Markascherite, Cu&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(MoO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)(OH)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;, a new mineral species polymorphic with szenicsite, from Copper Creek, Pinal County, Arizona, U.S.A., American Mineralogist 97, 197-202</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>07.GB.??</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Molybdate, Wolframate or Niobate, With additional anions and/or H2O</gsmin:strunzlabel>
