    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Vranaite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Cempírek J, Grew E S, Kampf A R, Ma C, Novák M, Gadas P, Škoda R, Galiová M V, Pezzotta F, Groat L A, Krivovichev S V (2016) Vránaite, ideally Al_16_B_4_Si_4_O_38_, a new mineral related to boralsilite, Al_16_B_6_Si_2_O_37_, from the Manjaka pegmatite, Sahatany Valley, Madagascar. American Mineralogist 101, 2108-2117</gsmin:statusnotes>
  </rdf:Description>
