    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Nechelyustov G N, Christyakova N I, Zav'yalov E N (1984) Nevskite, Bi(Se,S), a new bismuth selenide, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 113(3), 351-355</gsmin:statusnotes>
