    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Roberts A C, Ansell H G, Dunn P J (1981) Comancheite, a new mercury oxychloride-bromide from Terlingua, Texas, The Canadian Mineralogist 19, 393-396 Chemical formula changed from Hg_13_O_9_(Cl,Br)_8_: Williams P A, Hatert F, Pasero M, Mills S J (2013) IMA Commission on new minerals, nomenclature and classification (CNMNC) Newsletter 16. New minerals and nomenclature modifications approved in 2013. Mineralogical Magazine 77, 2695-2709</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>03.DD.65</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
