    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Tangeite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Tangeite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Nenadkewitch K, Volkov P (1926) La tanguéite - nouvell espèce minérale des mines de Tjuja Moujoun en Ferghana, Comptes Rendus (Doklady) de l’Académie des Sciences de l’URSS 1926, 43-46 Calciovolborthite = tangeite, decided to keep name calciovolborthite. Jambor J L, Puziewicz J (1990) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 75, 1209-1216 Calciovolborthite = tangeite, decided to change name to tangeite, because there is no formal relationship with volborthite. Basso R, Zefiro L (1994) Mineral nomenclature: status of calciovolborthite and tangeite, Neues Jahrbuch für Mineralogie, Monatshefte 1994, 205-208</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Adelite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>08.BH.35</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Phosphate, etc. with additional anions, without H2O, With medium-sized and large cations, (OH,etc.):RO4 = 1:1</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Tangeite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1926</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
