    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-31408.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">NaK&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;MgCa&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Al&lt;sub&gt;13&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;47&lt;/sub&gt;)O&lt;sub&gt;120&lt;/sub&gt;·36H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Direnzoite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Direnzoite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Galli E, Gualtieri A F (2008) Direnzoite, [NaK&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;MgCa&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Al&lt;sub&gt;13&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;47&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;120&lt;/sub&gt;)·36H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O], a new zeolite from Massif Central (France): Description and crystal structure, American Mineralogist 93, 95-102</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.GF.55</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
