    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chukanov N V, Pekov I V, Zadov A E (2007) Attikaite, Ca&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;Cu&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(AsO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;·2H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, a new mineral, Zapiski Rossiiskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchetstva 136(2), 17-24</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>08.DJ.45</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
