    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Peacor D R, Dunn P J, Simmons W B (1984) Earlshannonite, the Mn analogue of whitmoreite, from North Carolina, The Canadian Mineralogist 22, 471-474</gsmin:statusnotes>
