    <dct:source xml:lang="en">North American Commission on Stratigraphic Nomenclature, 1983</dct:source>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Geologic unit defined by primary magnetic-polarity record imposed whien the rock was deposited or crystallized during a specific interval of geologic time. Kind of chronostratigraphic unit and kind of geophysical unit.</rdfs:comment>
