    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Yushkinite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Yushkinite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Makeev A B, Evstigneeva T L, Troneva N V, Vyalsov L N, Gorshkov A I, Trubkin N V (1984) Yushkinite V_1-x_S·&lt;i&gt;n&lt;/i&gt;[(Mg,Al)(OH)_2_] - a new mineral, Mineralogiceskij Zhurnal 6, 91-98 Chemical formula redefined: Moëlo Y, Rouer O, Cario L, Cervelle B (1999) Re-examination of yushkinite: chemical composition, optical properties and interlayer charge transfer, Mineralogical Magazine 63, 879-889</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Valleriite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
