    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Pasero M, Yaskovskaya A N, Chukanov N V, Pushcharovsky D Y, Merlino S, Zubkova N V, Kononkova N N, Men’shikov Y P, Zadov A E (2007) Fluorcalciobritholite, (Ca,REE)_5_[(Si,P)O_4_]_3_F, a new mineral: description and crystal chemistry, European Journal of Mineralogy 19, 95-103 Chemical formula revised: Pasero M, Kampf A R, Ferraris C, Pekov I V, Rakovan J R, White T J (2010) Nomenclature of the apatite supergroup minerals, European Journal of Mineralogy 22, 163-179</gsmin:statusnotes>
