    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Fantappièite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Fantappieite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Cámara F, Bellatreccia F, Della Ventura G, Mottana A, Bindi L, Gunter M E, Sebastiani M (2010) Fantappièite, a new mineral of the cancrinite-sodalite group with a 33-layer stacking sequence: Occurrence and crystal structure, American Mineralogist 95, 472-480</gsmin:statusnotes>
