    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Nickeltalmessite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chukanov N V, Mukhanova A A, Möckel S, Belakovskiy D I, Levitskaya L A (2009) Nickeltalmessite, Ca2Ni(AsO4)2·2H2O - a new fairfieldite-group mineral from Bou Azzer, Morocco (abstract), Zapiski Rossiiskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchetstva 138, issue 4, 32-39</gsmin:statusnotes>
