    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Grice J D, Gault R A (1995) Varennesite, a new species of hydrated Na-Mn silicate with a unique monophyllosilicate structure, The Canadian Mineralogist 33, 1073-1081</gsmin:statusnotes>
