    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Calciocatapleiite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Portnov A M (1964) Calcium catapleite, a new variety of catapleite, Doklady Akademii Nauk SSSR 154, 607-609 Mineral name changed from calcium catapleiite: Burke E A J (2008) Tidying up mineral names: an IMA-CNMNC scheme for suffixes, hyphens and diacritical marks, The Mineralogical Record 39, 131-135</gsmin:statusnotes>
