    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mitchell R H, Yakovenchuk V N, Chakhmouradian A R, Burns P C, Pakhomovsky Y A (2000) Henrymeyerite, a new hollandite-type Ba-Fe titanate from the Kovdor Complex, Russia, The Canadian Mineralogist 38, 617-626</gsmin:statusnotes>
