    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Hussak E, Prior G T (1897) On tripuhyite, a new antimonate of iron, from Tripuhy, Brazil, Mineralogical Magazine 11, 302-303 Chemical formula redefined: Berlepsch P, Armbuster T, Brugger J, Criddle A J, Graeser S (2003) Tripuhyite, FeSbO_4_, revisited, Mineralogical Magazine 67, 31-46</gsmin:statusnotes>
