    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mihálik P, Hiemstra S A, De Villiers J P R (1975) Rustenburgite and atokite, two new platinum-group minerals from the Merensky Reef, Bushveld igneous complex, The Canadian Mineralogist 13, 146-150</gsmin:statusnotes>
