    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Johan Z (1961) Paxite - Cu2As3, a new copper arsenide from Cerný Dul in the Giant Mts. (Krkonoše), Acta Universitatis Carolinae - Geologica 2, 77-86 Fleischer M (1962) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 47, 1482-1485</gsmin:statusnotes>
