    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Na&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;20&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)O&lt;sub&gt;48&lt;/sub&gt;·13H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffids>R061116</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Dachiardite-Na</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Dachiardite-Na</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Sodium rich phase described: Alberti A (1975) Sodium-rich dachiardite from Alpe di Siusi, Italy. Contributions to Mineralogy and Petrology 49, 63-66 Name created to indicate the Na-rich phase: Coombs D S, Alberti A, Armbruster T, Artioli G, Colella C, Galli E, Grice J D, Liebau F, Mandarino J A, Minato H, Nickel E H, Passaglia E, Peacor D R, Quartieri S, Rinaldi R, Ross M, Sheppard R A, Tillmanns E, Vezzalini G, (1997) Recommended nomenclature for zeolite minerals: report of the subcommittee on zeolites of the International Mineralogical Association, commission on new minerals and mineral names, The Canadian Mineralogist 35, 1571-1606</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Dachiardite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.GD.40</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
