    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Cámara F, Cossio R, Regis D, Cerantola V, Ciriotti M E, Compagnoni R (2018) Beltrandoite, a new root-name in the högbomite supergroup: the Mg end-member magnesiobeltrandoite-2&lt;i&gt;N&lt;/i&gt;3&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;. European Journal of Mineralogy 30, 545-558</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Hogbömite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
