    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Fejer E E, Clark A M, Couper A G, Elliott C J (1977) Claringbullite, a new hydrated copper chloride, Mineralogical Magazine 41, 433-436 Chemical formula revised from Cu_4_Cl(OH)_7_·0.5H_2_O: Burns P C, Cooper M A, Hawthorne F C (1995) Claringbullite: A Cu&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt; oxysalt with Cu&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt; in trigonal-prismatic coordination, The Canadian Mineralogist 33, 633-639 Chemical formula revised from Cu^2+^_4_Cl(OH)(OH)_6_: Hålenius U, Hatert F, Pasero M, Mills S J (2016) IMA Commission on New Minerals, Nomenclature and Classification (CNMNC) Newsletter 29. New minerals and nomenclature modifications approved in 2015 and 2016. Mineralogical Magazine 80, 199-205</gsmin:statusnotes>
