    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Popova V I, Popov V A, Clark A H, Polyakov V O, Borisovskii S E (1986) Alacránite, As&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;S&lt;sub&gt;9&lt;/sub&gt; – a new mineral, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 115(3), 360-368 Chemical formula changed: Burns P C, Percival J B (2001) Alacranite, As&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;S&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;: a new occurrence, new formula, and determination of the crystal structure, The Canadian Mineralogist 39, 809-818 Chemical formula changed again: Bonazzi P, Bindi L, Popova V, Pratesi G, Menchetti S (2003) Alacranite, As&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;S&lt;sub&gt;9&lt;/sub&gt;: structural study of the holotype and re-assignment of the original chemical formula, American Mineralogist 88, 1796-1800</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>02.FA.20</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Other sulfide with As, (Sb), S</gsmin:strunzlabel>
