    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Ananyev S A, Konovalenko S I, Rastsvetaeva R K, Aksenov S M, Chukanov N V, Sapozhnikov A N, Zagorsky V E, Virus A A (2011) Tashelgite, CaMgFe2+Al9O16(OH), a new mineral species from calc-skarnoid in Gorny Shoria, Geology of Ore Deposits 53, 751-757</gsmin:statusnotes>
