    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Saryarkite-(Y)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Krol O F, Chernov V I, Shipovalov Y V, Khan G A (1964) Saryarkite, a new mineral, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 93, issue 2, 147-155 Name changed from saryarkite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>08.DO.25</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Phosphate, etc. with additional anions and H2O, With CO3, SO4, SiO4</gsmin:strunzlabel>
