    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Aurisicchio C, Orlandi P, Pasero M, Perchiazzi N (1993) Uranopolycrase, the uranium-dominant analogue of polycrase-(Y), a new mineral from Elba Island, Italy, and its crystal structure, European Journal of Mineralogy 5, 1161-1165</gsmin:statusnotes>
