    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Zubkova N V, Yapaskurt V O, Polekhovsky Y S, Vigasina M F, Belakovskiy D I, Britvin S N, Sidorov E G, Pushcharovsky D Y (2016) New arsenate minerals from the Arsenatnaya fumarole, Tolbachik volcano, Kamchatka, Russia. VI. Melanarsite, K_3_Cu_7_Fe^3+^O_4_(AsO_4_)_4_. Mineralogical Magazine 80, 855-867</gsmin:statusnotes>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/perovskite">
