    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Miyajima H, Matsubara S, Miyawaki R, Ito K (1999) Itoigawaite, a new mineral, the Sr analogue of lawsonite, in jadeitite from the Itoigawa-Ohmi district, central Japan, Mineralogical Magazine 63, 909-916</gsmin:statusnotes>
