    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Ag&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;Pb&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;Bi&lt;sub&gt;5&lt;/sub&gt;S&lt;sub&gt;13&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Ourayite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Ourayite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Makovicky E, Karup-Møller S (1977) Chemistry and crystallography of the lillianite homologous series. Part II: Definition of new minerals: eskimoite, vikingite, ourayite, and treasurite. Redefinition of schirmerite and new data on the lillianite-gustavite solid solution series, Neues Jahrbuch für Mineralogie, Abhandlungen 131, 56-82 Fleischer M, Chao G Y, Pabst A (1979) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 64, 241-245</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Lillianite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>02.JB.40c</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">PbS type sulfosalt with Pb</gsmin:strunzlabel>
