  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geologicfoliation/irregular_lamination">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Lamination fabric in which individual lamina or groups of lamina are warped in an irregular fashion, like a flattened peice of crumpled paper. A crude planar orientation is discernible.</rdfs:comment>
