    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Khomyakov A P, Nechelyustov G N, Rastsvetaeva R K, Rozenberg K A (2012) Davinciite, Na&lt;sub&gt;12&lt;/sub&gt;K&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;Ca&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;Zr&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;26&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;73&lt;/sub&gt;OH)Cl&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;, a new K,Na-ordered mineral of the eudialyte group from the Khibiny alkaline massif, Kola Peninsula, Russia, Zapiski Rossiiskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchetstva 141(2), 10-21</gsmin:statusnotes>
