    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Xu H, Lee S, Xu H (2017) Luogufengite: A new nano-mineral of Fe_2_O_3_ polymorph with giant coercive field. American Mineralogist 102, 711-719</gsmin:statusnotes>
