    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Ominelite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Hiroi Y, Grew E S, Motoyoshi Y, Peacor D R, Rouse R C, Matsubara S, Yokoyama K, Miyawaki R, Mcgee J J, Su S, Hokada T, Furukawa N, Shibasaki H (2001) Ominelite, (Fe,Mg)Al3BSiO9 (Fe2+ analogue of grandidierite), a new mineral from porphyritic granite in Japan, American Mineralogist 87, 160-170 Mandarino J A (2002) New minerals, The Canadian Mineralogist 40, 1215-1234</gsmin:statusnotes>
