    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Outerbridge W F, Staatz M H, Meyrowitz R, Pommer A M (1960) Weeksite, a new uranium silicate from the Thomas Range, Juab County, Utah, American Mineralogist 45, 39-52 Chemical formula revised: Jackson J M, Burns P C (2001) A re-evaluation of the structure of weeksite, a uranyl silicate framework mineral, The Canadian Mineralogist 39, 187-195 Chemical formula revised again: Fejfarová K, Plášil J, Yang H, Cejka J, Dušek M, Downs R T, Barkley M C, Škoda R (2012) Revision of the crystal structure and chemical formula of weeksite, K_2_(UO_2_)_2_(Si_5_O_13_)·4H_2_O American Mineralogist 97, 750-754</gsmin:statusnotes>
