    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Jambor J L, Vinals J, Groat L A, Raudsepp M (2002) Cobaltarthurite, Co&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;Fe&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(AsO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;· 4H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, a new member of the arthurite group, The Canadian Mineralogist 40, 725-732</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Arthurite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>08.DC.15</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
