    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chukanov N V, Pekov I V, Zadov A E, Rozenberg K A, Rastsvetaeva R K, Krivovichev S V, Levitskaya L A (2004) New minerals tsepinite-K (K,Ba,Na)_2_(Ti,Nb)_2_(Si_4_O_12_)(OH,O)_2_·3H_2_O and paratsepinite-Ba (Ba,Na,K)_2-x_(Ti,Nb)_2_(Si_4_O_12_)(OH,O)_2_·4H_2_O and their relationship with other labuntsovite group minerals (Summary), The Canadian Mineralogist 42, 234-234</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Labuntsovite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.CE.30b</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Cyclosilicate: [Si4O12]8- 4-membered single rings (vierer-Einfachringe), without insular complex anions</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Paratsepinite-Ba.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>2002-006</gsmin:wikipediadate>
