    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mineev D A, Lavrishcheva T I, Bykova A V (1970) Yttrian bastnaesite, a product of the alteration of gagarinite, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 99, 328-332</gsmin:statusnotes>
