    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Magnesiohogbomite-2N3S</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Designated as hogbomite-5H: McKie D (1963) The högbomite polytypes, Mineralogical Magazine 33, 563-580 Designated as hogbomite-10T: Hejny C, Armbruster T (2002) Polysomatism in högbomite: The crystal structures of 10T, 12H, 14T, and 24R polysomes, American Mineralogist 87, 277-292 Chemical formula modified and name changed from hogbomite-10T: Armbruster T (2002) Revised nomenclature of högbomite, nigerite, and taafeite minerals, European Journal of Mineralogy 14, 389-395</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Hogbömite-Magnesiohogbömite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
