    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Hogarth D D (1977) Classification and nomenclature of the pyrochlore group, American Mineralogist 62, 403-410 Cerny P, Hawthorne F C, Laflamme J H G, Hinthorne J R (1979) Stibiobetafite, a new member of the pyrochlore group from Venzá, Czechoslovakia, The Canadian Mineralogist 17, 583-588 Name changed from stibiobetafite, and redefined: Atencio D, Andrade M B, Christy A G, Gieré R, Kartashov P M (2010) The pyrochlore supergroup of minerals: nomenclature, The Canadian Mineralogist 48, 673-698</gsmin:statusnotes>
