    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Raup O B, Gude A J, Dwornik E J, Cuttitta F, Rose H J (1968) Braitschite, a new hydrous calcium rare-earth borate mineral from the Paradox Basin, Grand County, Utah, American Mineralogist 53, 1081-1095 Name changed from braitschite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042 Chemical formula revised: Rowland C E, Cahill C L, Post J E (2011) The structure of braitschite, a calcium rare earth borate, American Mineralogist 96, 197-201</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>06.H0.10</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Borate, unclassified</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Braitschite-%28Ce%29.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1967-029</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
