    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Semenov E I, Chang P S (1961) Huanghoite, a new rare-earth mineral, Scientia Sinica 10, 1007-1011 Name changed from huanghoite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>05.BD.35</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
