    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Birch W D, Pring A, Kolitsch U (1999) Bleasdaleite (Ca,Fe&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Cu&lt;sub&gt;5&lt;/sub&gt;(Bi,Cu)(PO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O,OH,Cl)&lt;sub&gt;13&lt;/sub&gt; A new mineral from Lake Boga, Victoria, Australia, Australian Journal of Mineralogy 5, 69-75</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>08.DK.25</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
