    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Yarzhemskii Y Y (1956) Preobrazhenskite - a new borate of the saliferous strata of the Inder uplift, Doklady Akademii Nauk SSSR 111, 1087-1090 Fleischer M (1957) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 42, 704-704 Chemical formula changed: Ostrovskaya I V, Nikitina I B (1969) The formula of preobrazhenskite, Trudy Mineralogicheskogo Muzeya Akademiya Nauk SSSR 19, 206-209 Fleischer M (1970) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 55, 1067-1073</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>06.GB.15</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Phyllo-nonborate, etc.</gsmin:strunzlabel>
