    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Della Ventura G, Bonazzi P, Oberti R, Ottolini L (2002) Ciprianiite and mottanaite-(Ce), two new minerals of the hellandite group from Latium (Italy), American Mineralogist 87, 739-744 Formula changed from Ca_4_(CeCa)AlBe_2_(Si_4_B_4_O_22_)O_2_: Hålenius U, Hatert F, Pasero M, Mills S J (2018) IMA Commission on New Minerals, Nomenclature and Classification (CNMNC) Newsletter 45. New minerals and nomenclature modifications approved in 2018. Mineralogical Magazine 82, Preprint</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Hellandite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.DK.20</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Inosilicate with 5-periodic single chains</gsmin:strunzlabel>
