    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Kampf A R, Marty J, Nash B P, Plášil J, Kasatkin A V, Škoda R (2012) Calciodelrioite, Ca(VO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;, the Ca analogue of delrioite, Sr(VO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;, Mineralogical Magazine 76, 2803-2817</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Delrioite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>04.HG.35</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
