    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-1309.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">NaSr&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;CaY(CO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;·3H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffids>R110164</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Donnayite-(Y)</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Donnayite-(Y)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chao G Y, Mainwaring P R, Baker J (1978) Donnayite, NaCaSr&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;Y(CO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;·3H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, a new mineral from Mont St-Hilaire, Québec, The Canadian Mineralogist 16, 335-340 Name changed from donnayite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>05.CC.05</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Carbonate without additional anions, with H2O, With rare earth elements (REE)</gsmin:strunzlabel>
