    <gsmin:rruffids>R070062</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Nabokoite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Nabokoite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Popova V I, Popov V A, Rudashevskiy N S, Glavatskikh S F, Polyakov V O, Bushmakin A F (1987) Nabokoite Cu7TeO4(SO4)5·KCl and atlasovite Cu6Fe3+Bi3+O4(SO4)5·KCl. New minerals of volcanic exhalations, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 116, issue 3, 358-367 Jambor J L, Bladh K W, Ercit T S, Grice J D, Grew E S (1988) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 73, 927-935</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>07.BC.20</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
