    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Phosphowalpurgite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Phosphowalpurgite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Sejkora J, Cejka J, Hloušek J, Novák M, Šrein V (2004) Phosphowalpurgite, the (PO4)-dominant analogue of walpurgite from Smrkovec, Slavkovský Les Mountains, Czech Republic, The Canadian Mineralogist 42, 963-972 Piilonen P C, Ercit T S, Roberts A C (2005) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 90, 768-773</gsmin:statusnotes>
