    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Vasilev V I, Lavrentev Y G, Palchik N A (1986) Kuzminite Hg_2_(Br,Cl)_2_- a new natural mercury halide, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 115, 595-598</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>03.AA.30</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
