    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Cesanite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Cavarretta G, Mottana A, Trece F (1981) Cesanite, Ca&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Na&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;[(OH)(SO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;], a sulphate isotypic to apatite, from the Cesano geothermal field (Latium, Italy), Mineralogical Magazine 44, 269-273</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Apatite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
