    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Makovicky E, Topa D, Balic-Žunic T (2001) The crystal structure of paarite, the newly discovered 56 Å derivative of the bismuthinite–aikinite solid–solution series, The Canadian Mineralogist 39, 1377-1382 Jambor J L, Roberts A C (2004) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 89, 1826-1834</gsmin:statusnotes>
