    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Fluor-uvite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Kunitz W (1930) Die Mischungsreihen in der Turmalingruppe und die genetischen Beziehungen zwischen Turmalinen und Glimmern, Chemie der Erde 4, 208-251 Chemical composition revised according to: Clark C M, Hawthorne F C, Grice J D (2010) Uvite, IMA2000-030a. CNMNC Newsletter, April 2010, page 377; Mineralogical Magazine, 74, 375–377 Name changed from uvite to fluor-uvite: Henry D J, Novák M, Hawthorne F C, Ertl A, Dutrow B L, Uher P, Pezzotta F (2011) Nomenclature of the tourmaline-supergroup minerals, American Mineralogist 96, 895-913</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Tourmaline</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.CK.05</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Cyclosilicate: [Si6O18]12- 6-membered single rings, with insular complex anions</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Uvite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>2000-030a, '1930</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/pumpellyite-mg">
