    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Palache C, Vassar H E (1925) Some minerals of the Keweenawan copper deposits: pumpellyite, a new mineral; sericite; saponite, American Mineralogist 10, 412-418 Name changed from pumpellyite: Passaglia E, Gottardi G (1973) Crystal chemistry and nomenclature of pumpellyites and julgoldites, The Canadian Mineralogist 12, 219-223</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Pumpellyite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.BG.20</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
