    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Redefined: Pardee J T, Larsen E S, Steiger G (1921) Bementite and neotocite from western Washington, with conclusions as to the identity of bementite and caryopilite, Journal of the Washington Academy of Sciences 11, 25-32</gsmin:statusnotes>
