    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">The mineral species is discovered, but it is misidentified: Clarke F W, Catlett C (1889) A platiniferous nickel ore from Canada, The American Journal of Science 137, 372-374 The mineral is found at a new locality, characterized, and named: Lindgren W, Davy W M (1924) Nickel ores from Key West Mine, Nevada, Economic Geology 19, 309-319</gsmin:statusnotes>
