    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Hydroxylbastnasite-(Ce)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Kirillov A S (1964) A new variety of bastnaesite - hydroxyl-bastnaesite. Doklady Akademii Nauk SSSR 159(5), 1048-1050 Name changed from hydroxyl bastnasite to hydroxyl-bastnasite-(Ce): Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042 Name changed from hydroxyl-bastnasite-(Ce) to hydroxylbastnäsite-(Ce): Burke E A J (2008) Tidying up mineral names: an IMA-CNMNC scheme for suffixes, hyphens and diacritical marks, The Mineralogical Record 39, 131-135</gsmin:statusnotes>
