    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Yang H, Downs R T, Evans S H, Pinch W W (2014) Lavinskyite, K(LiCu)Cu_6_(Si_4_O_11_)_2_(OH)_4_, isotypic with plancheite, a new mineral from the Wessels mine, Kalahari Manganese Fields, South Africa. American Mineralogist 99, 525-530</gsmin:statusnotes>
