    <dct:source xml:lang="en">Geoscience Victoria, Australia</dct:source>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A linear alignment of fabric elements, especially elongate or rod-shaped minerals, interpreted to have been aligned by flow of magma, lava, pyroclastic material, or diapiric flow of sedimentary rock.</rdfs:comment>
