    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Erd R C, Cesbron F P, Goff F E, Clark J R (1981) Mcguinnessite, a new carbonate from California, The Mineralogical Record 121, 143-147 Chemical formula changed from (Mg,Cu)_2_CO_3_(OH)_2_ because the Cu and Mg are found to order into distinct crystallographic sites: Perchiazzi N (2006) Crystal structure determination and Rietveld refinement of rosasite and mcguinnessite, Zeitschrift für Kristallographie Supplement 23, 505-510</gsmin:statusnotes>
