    <gsmin:rruffids>R130041</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Tarbagataite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Tarbagataite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Stepanov A V, Bekenova G K, Levin V L, Sokolova E, Hawthorne F C, Dobrovol'skaya E A (2012) Tarbagataite, (K,_)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Ca,Na)(Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;,Mn)&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;Ti&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;12&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(OH,F), a new astrophyllite-group mineral species from the Verkhnee Espe Deposit, Akjailyautas Mountains, Kazakhstan: Description and crystal structure, The Canadian Mineralogist 50, 159-168</gsmin:statusnotes>
