    <gsmin:rruffids>R040021 | R050017 | R050097 | R050647 | R060465 | R061012</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Heulandite-Ca</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Heulandite-Ca</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Brooke H J (1822) On the comptonite of Vesuvius, the brewsterite of Scotland, the stilbite and the heulandite, Edinburgh Philosophy Journal 6, 112-115 Name changed from heulandite: Coombs D S, Alberti A, Armbruster T, Artioli G, Colella C, Galli E, Grice J D, Liebau F, Mandarino J A, Minato H, Nickel E H, Passaglia E, Peacor D R, Quartieri S, Rinaldi R, Ross M, Sheppard R A, Tillmanns E, Vezzalini G, (1997) Recommended nomenclature for zeolite minerals: report of the Subcommittee on Zeolites of the International Mineralogical Association, Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names, The Canadian Mineralogist 35, 1571-1606</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.GE.05</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Zeolite family: Chains of T10O20 Tetrahedra</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Heulandite-Ca.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1997</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
