    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chukanov N V, Krivovichev S V, Chernyatieva A P (2013) Vendidaite, Al_2_(SO_4_)(OH)_3_Cl·6H_2_O, a new mineral from La Vendida copper mine, Antofagasta region, Chile. The Canadian Mineralogist 51, 559-568</gsmin:statusnotes>
