    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Georgeite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Bridge P J, Just J, Hey M H (1979) Georgeite, a new amorphous copper carbonate from the Carr Boyd mine, Western Australia, Mineralogical Magazine 43, 97-98 Formula revised from Cu_5_(CO_3_)_3_(OH)_4_·6H_2_O: Pollard A M, Thomas R G, Williams P A, Just J, Bridge P J (1991) The synthesis and composition of georgeite and its reactions to form other secondary copper(II) carbonates. Mineralogical Magazine 55, 163-166</gsmin:statusnotes>
