    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Meisser N, Brugger J, Ansermet S, Thélin P, Bussy F (2010) Françoisite-(Ce), a new mineral species from La Creusaz uranium deposit (Valais, Switzerland) and from Radium Ridge (Flinders Ranges, South Australia): Description and genesis, American Mineralogist 95, 1527-1532</gsmin:statusnotes>
