    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Tyretskite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chemical formula revised: Davies W O, Machin M P (1968) Strontiohilgardite-1Tc and tyretskite, a structural pair, American Mineralogist 53, 2084-2087 Chemical formula revised: Ghose S (1985) A new nomenclature for the borate minerals in the hilgardite (Ca2B5O9Cl·H2O)–tyretskite (Ca2B5O9OH·H2O) group, American Mineralogist 70, 636-637</gsmin:statusnotes>
