    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Chabazite-Sr</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Turchkova A G, Chukanov N V, Zadov A E, Grichin V G (2000) Chabazite-Sr, (Sr,Ca)[Al&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Si&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;12&lt;/sub&gt;]·6H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, a new zeolite mineral from Lovozero massif, Kola Peninsula, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 129(4), 54-58</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.GD.10</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Zeolite family: Chains of 6-membered rings – tabular zeolites</gsmin:strunzlabel>
