    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Reddingite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Brush G J, Dana E S (1878) On a new and remarkable mineral locality in Fairfield County, Connecticut; with a description of several new species occurring there. First Paper., American Journal of Science and Arts 116, 33-46; 114-123 Redefined: Moore P B, Araki T, Kampf A R (1980) Nomenclature of the phosphoferrite structure type: refinements of landesite and kryzhanovskite, Mineralogical Magazine 43, 789-795</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Reddingite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
