    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Previously observed many times, but only described as a new mineral in this paper: Gianfagna A, Scordari F, Mazziotti-Tagliani S, Ventruti G, Ottolini L (2007) Fluorophlogopite from Biancavilla (Mt. Etna, Sicily, Italy): Crystal structure and crystal chemistry of a new F-dominant analog of phlogopite, American Mineralogist 92, 1601-1609</gsmin:statusnotes>
