    <dct:source xml:lang="en">LeMaitre et al. 2002</dct:source>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Syenitic rock that contains between 0 and 5 percent quartz and no feldspathoid mineral in the QAPF fraction. Defined modally in QAPF Field 7.</rdfs:comment>
