  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/common/Immaterial_Feature">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dependent place feature that is immaterial.  E.g. voids, shadows and relational features such as traffic intersections (meeting of roads).   MPF(x) &lt;--&gt; DPF(x) ^ not mat(x)</rdfs:comment>
