    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">A mineral distinct from wollastonite was observed but not named: Tilley C E (1937) Wollastonite solid solutions from Scawt Hill, Co. Antrim. Mineralogical Magazine 24, 569-572 Rapoport P A, Burnham C W (1973) Ferrobustamite: The crystal structures of two Ca,Fe bustamite-type pyroxenoids, Zeitschrift für Kristallographie 138, 419-438</gsmin:statusnotes>
