    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Begizov V D, Meshichankina V I, Dubakina L S (1974) Palladoarsenide, Pd2As, a new natural palladium arsenide from the copper-nickel deposits of the Oktyabr deposits, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 103, issue 1, 104-107 Fleischer M, Potter R W (1975) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 60, 161-163</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>02.AC.25a</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Sulfide or sulfosalt alloy of metalloids with PGE</gsmin:strunzlabel>
