    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chukanov N V, Zubkova N V, Pekov I P, Belakovskiy D I, Schüller W, Ternes B, Blass G, Pushcharovsky D Y (2012) Hillesheimite, (K,Ca,[box])_2_(Mg,Fe,Ca,[box])_2_[(Si,Al)_13_O_23_(OH)_6_]·(OH)·8H_2_O, a new phyllosilicate mineral of the günterblassite group. Zapiski Rossiiskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchetstva 141(3), 29-38</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Günterblassite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
