    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Al(PO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)·2H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:imachemistry>
