    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Redondite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mineral is described but not named: Shepard C U (1869) On a mineral phosphate from the island of Redonda, W. I., American Journal of Science and Arts 47, 428-429 The mineral is named: Shepard C U (1870) Redondite, American Journal of Science and Arts 50, 96-96</gsmin:statusnotes>
