    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Lengauer C L, Hrauda N, Kolitsch U, Krickl R, Tillmanns E (2009) Friedrichbeckeite, K([box]_0.5_Na_0.5_)_2_(Mg_0.8_Mn_0.1_Fe_0.1_)_2_(Be_0.6_Mg_0.4_)_3_[Si_12_O_30_], a new milarite-type mineral from the Bellerberg volcano, Eifel area, Germany, Mineralogy and Petrology 96, 221-232</gsmin:statusnotes>
