    <gsmin:rruffids>R070140</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Choloalite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Choloalite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Williams S A (1981) Choloalite, CuPb(TeO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, a new mineral, Mineralogical Magazine 44, 55-57 Chemical formula changed to CuPb(TeO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;: Powell D W, Thomas R G, Williams P A, Birch W D, Plimer I R (1994) Choloalite: synthesis and revised chemical formula, Mineralogical Magazine 58, 505-508 Chemical formula revised again: Lam A E, Groat L A, Grice J D, Ercit T S (1999) The crystal structure of choloalite, The Canadian Mineralogist 37, 721-729</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>04.JK.45</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Tellurite without additional anions, without H2O</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Choloalite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1980-019</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
