    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Yugawaralite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Sakurai K, Hayashi A (1952) “Yugawaralite”, a new zeolite, Science Reports of the Yokohama National University 1, 69-77 Chemical formula changed from Ca_4_Al_7_Si_20_O_54_·14H_2_O to CaAl_2_Si_6_O_16_·4H_2_O: Leimer H W, Slaughter M (1969) The determination and refinement of the crystal structure of yugawaralite. Zeitschrift für Kristallographie 130, 88-111</gsmin:statusnotes>
