    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pautov L A, Belakovsky D I, Scala R, Sokolova E V (1992) Vistepite Mn_5_SnB_2_Si_5_O_20_ - a new borosilicate of manganese and tin, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 121(4), 107-112</gsmin:statusnotes>
