    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Armbruster T, Gnos E, Dixon R, Gutzmer J, Hejny C, Döbelin N, Medenbach O (2002) Manganvesuvianite and tweddillite, two new Mn3+-silicate minerals, Mineralogical Magazine 66, 137-150 Jambor J L, Roberts A C (2003) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 88, 251-255</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Vesuvianite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
