    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Pokrovskite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Ivanov O K, Malinovskii Y A, Mozherin Y V (1984) Pokovskite, Mg2(CO3)(OH)2·0.5H2O, a new mineral from the Zlatorgorskaya, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 113, issue 1, 90-95 Dunn P J, Chao G Y, Fleischer M, Ferraiolo J A, Langley R H, Pabst A, Zilczer J A (1985) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 70, 214-221 Chemical formula revised: Perchiazzi N, Merlino S (2006) The malachite-rosasite group: crystal structures of glaukospaerite and pokrovskite, European Journal of Mineralogy 18, 787-792</gsmin:statusnotes>
