    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Voloshin A V, Pakhomovskii Y A, Bakhchisaraitsev A Y (1990) Lithiowodginite - a new mineral of the wodginite group from the granitic pegmatites of eastern Kazakhstan, Mineralogiceskij Zhurnal 12, 94-100</gsmin:statusnotes>
