    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Witzke T, Kolitsch U, Krause W, Wiechowski A, Medenbach O, Kampf A R, Steele I M, Favreau G (2006) Guanacoite, Cu_2_Mg_2_(Mg_0.5_Cu_0.5_)(OH)_4_(H_2_O)_4_(AsO_4_)_2_, a new arsenate mineral species from the El Guanaco Mine, near Taltal, Chile: description and crystal structure, European Journal of Mineralogy 18, 813-821</gsmin:statusnotes>
