    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Galuskina I O, Galuskin E V, Armbruster T, Lazic B, Dzierzanowski P, Gazeev V M, Prusik K, Pertsev N N, Winiarski A, Zadov A E, Wrzalik R, Gurbanov A G (2010) Bitikleite-(SnAl) and bitikleite-(ZrFe): New garnets from xenoliths of the Upper Chegem volcanic structure, Kabardino-Balkaria, Northern Caucasus, Russia, American Mineralogist 95, 959-967 Name changed from bitikleite-(SnAl) to bitikleite: Grew E S, Locock A J, Mills S J, Galuskina I O, Galuskin E V, Hålenius U (2013) Nomenclature of the garnet supergroup, American Mineralogist 98, 785-811</gsmin:statusnotes>
