    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Harris D C (1974) Ruthenarsenite and iridarsenite, two new minerals from the territory of Papua and New Guinea and associated irarsite, laurite and cubic iron-bearing platinum, The Canadian Mineralogist 12, 280-284</gsmin:statusnotes>
