    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Reznitskii L, Clark C M, Hawthorne F C, Grice J D, Skogby H, Hålenius U, Bosi F (2014) Chromo-alumino-povondraite, NaCr_3_(Al_4_Mg_2_)(Si_6_O_18_)(BO_3_)_3_(OH)_3_O, a new mineral species of the tourmaline supergroup. American Mineralogist 99, 1767-1773</gsmin:statusnotes>
