    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Imogolite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Insufficiently defined, and so rejected by IMA: Yoshinaga N, Aomine S (1962) Imogolite in some Ando soils. Soil Science and Plant Nutrition 8, 114-121 Approved as a mineral species: Bayliss P (1987) Mineralogical notes: mineral nomenclature: imogolite, Mineralogical Magazine 51, 327-327</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Allophane</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.ED.20</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Phyllosilicate with kaolinite layers composed of tetrahedral and octahedral nets</gsmin:strunzlabel>
