    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Caryopilite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Hamberg A (1889) Über karyopilit, ein wasserhaltiges manganoxydulsilikat von der Grube Harstigen bei Pajsberg in Vermland, Geologiska Föreningens i Stockholm Förhandlingar 11, 27-32 Chemical formula revised from H_10_Mn_8_Si_7_O_27_: Peacor D R, Essene E J (1980) Caryopilite - a member of the friedelite rather than the serpentine group, American Mineralogist 65, 335-339</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Serpentine</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.ED.15</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Phyllosilicate with kaolinite layers composed of tetrahedral and octahedral nets</gsmin:strunzlabel>
