    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Schlüter J, Malcherek T, Mihailova B (2014) Galloplumbogummite from Tsumeb, Namibia, a new member of the alunite group with tetravalent charge balance. Neues Jahrbuch für Mineralogie, Abhandlungen 191, 301-309</gsmin:statusnotes>
