    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Birch W D, Grey I E, Mills S J, Bougerol C, Pring A, Ansermet S (2007) Pittongite, a new tungstate with a mixed-layer, pyrochlore-hexagonal tungsten bronze structure, from Victoria, Australia, The Canadian Mineralogist 45, 857-864 Poirier G, Tait K, Ercit T S, Rowe R, Piilonen P C (2008) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 93, 702-706</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>04.DH.45</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Oxide, Metal: Oxygen = 1:2 and similar, With large (+- medium-sized) cations; sheets of edge-sharing octahedra</gsmin:strunzlabel>
