    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Williams S A (1975) Xocomecatlite, Cu_3_TeO_4_(OH)_4_, and tlalocite, Cu_10_Zn_6_(TeO_3_)(TeO_4_)_2_Cl(OH)_25_·27H_2_O, two new minerals from Moctezuma, Sonora, Mexico, Mineralogical Magazine 40, 221-226</gsmin:statusnotes>
