    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Lovozerite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Gerassimovsky V I (1939) Lovozerite - a new mineral, Comptes Rendus (Doklady) de l’Académie des Sciences de l’URSS 25, 753-756 Chemical formula revised: Yamnova N A, Egorov-Tismenko Y K, Pekov I V (2001) Refined crystal structure of lovozerite Na_2_CaZr[Si_6_O_12_(OH,O)_6_]·H_2_O, Crystallography Reports 46, 937-941 Chemical formula revised again: Pekov I V, Krivovichev S V, Zolotarev A A, Yakovenchuk V N, Armbruster T, Pakhomovsky Y A (2009) Crystal chemistry and nomenclature of the lovozerite group, European Journal of Mineralogy 21, 1061-1071</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Lovozerite-Zirsinalite–Lovozerite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.CJ.15a</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Cyclosilicate: [Si6O18]12- 6-membered single rings (sechser-Einfachringe), without insular complex anions</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Lovozerite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>1939</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
