    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Named but not approved by IMA nomenclature commission: Prider R T (1965) Noonkanbahite, a potassic batisite from the lamproites of Western Australia, Mineralogical Magazine 34, 403-405 Mineral accepted by the IMA nomenclature commission: Uvarova Y A, Sokolova E, Hawthorne F C, Liferovich R P, Mitchell R H, Pekov I V, Zadov A E (2010) Noonkanbahite, BaKNaTi_2_(Si_4_O_12_)O_2_, a new mineral species: description and crystal structure, Mineralogical Magazine 74, 441-450</gsmin:statusnotes>
