    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Dong H, Peacor D R, Merriman R J, Kemp S J (2002) Brinrobertsite: a new RI interstratified pyrophyllite/smectite-like clay mineral: characterization and geological origin, Mineralogical Magazine 66, 605-617</gsmin:statusnotes>
