    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A relation between a non-abstact particular and a spatial location value - still in a test stage; intended as a short-cut for specifying the spatial location of something, but therefore equal to saying that something occupies space (in/directly) and has a spatial location quality with a certain spatial value (in a spatial reference system).</rdfs:comment>
