    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Xingzhongite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Mineral reported but not approved: Yu T H, Lin S J, Chao P, Fang C S, Huang C S (1974) A preliminary study of some new minerals of the platinum-group and another associated new one in platinum-bearing intrusions in a region of China. Acta Geologica Sinica 2, 202-218 Mineral approved by IMA: Peng Z, Chang C, Ximen L (1978) Discussion on published articles in the research of new minerals of the platinum-group discovered in China in recent years. Acta Geologica Sinica 4, 326-336 Chemical formula revised: Dunn P J, Cabri L J, Chao G Y, Fleischer M, Francis C A, Grice J D, Jambor J L, Pabst A (1984) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 69, 406-412</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Spinel</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>02.DA.05</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Metal sulfide (M:S = 3:4)</gsmin:strunzlabel>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Xingzhongite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>0</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/abswurmbachite">
