    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Reinecke T, Tillmanns E, Bernhardt H J (1991) Abswurmbachite, Cu&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;Mn&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;[O&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;/SiO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;], a new mineral of the braunite group: natural occurrence, synthesis, and crystal structure, Neues Jahrbuch fur Mineralogie, Abhandlungen 163, 117-143</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Braunite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
