    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Bonaccorsi E, Orlandi P (2003) Marinellite, a new feldspathoid of the cancrinite-sodalite group, European Journal of Mineralogy 15, 1019-1027 Jambor J L, Roberts A C (2004) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 89, 1826-1834</gsmin:statusnotes>
