    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Krenner J S (1892) Andorit, uj hazai ezüstércz, Matematikai és Természettudományi Értesitö 11, 119-122 This is the original andorite, also known as senandorite. Name changed to indicate the multiple of 6 units along its c-axis: Donnay J D H, Donnay G (1954) Syntaxic intergrowths in the andorite series, American Mineralogist 39, 161-171</gsmin:statusnotes>
