    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Razin L V, Dubakina L S, Meshchankina V I, Begizov V D (1975) Borishanskiite - a new plumboarsenide of palladium for the copper-nickel sulfides ores of the Talnakh differentiated intrusive, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 104(1), 57-61</gsmin:statusnotes>
