    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pring A, McBriar E M (1989) Mawbyite, a new arsenate of lead and iron related to tsumcorite and carminite, from Broken Hill, New South Wales, American Mineralogist 74, 1377-1381</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Natrochalcite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
