    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Yang Z, Ding K, De Fourestier J, Mao Q, Li H (2012) Ferrotaaffeite-2N'2S, a new mineral species, and the crystal structure of Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;-rich magnesiotaaffeite-2N'2S from the Xianghualing tin-polymetallic ore field, Hunan Province, China, The Canadian Mineralogist 50, 21-29</gsmin:statusnotes>
