    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Khomyakov A P, Semenov E I, Voronkov A A, Nechelyustov G N (1983) Terskite, Na_4_ZrSi_6_O_16_·2H_2_O, a new mineral, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 112(2), 226-232 Chemical formula changed from Na_4_ZrSi_6_O_16_·2H_2_O: Grice J D, Rowe R, Poirier G (2015) Hydroterskite: A new mineral species from the Saint-Amable Sill, Quebec, and a comparison with terskite and elpidite. The Canadian Mineralogist 53, 821-832</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Terskite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.DM.40</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
