    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">McAndrew J, Scott T R (1955) Stillwellite, a new rare-earth mineral from Queensland, Nature 176, 509-510 Name changed from stillwellite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042</gsmin:statusnotes>
