    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Rocha, R. B. et al. Toarcian Stage of Lower Jurassic defined by the Global Boundary Stratotype Section and Point (GSSP) at the Peniche section (Portugal). Episodes 39, 460–481 (2016).</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">base of bed 15e (Couches de passage), uppermost Lemede Formation, Peniche (Portugal)</rdfs:comment>
