    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Diversilite-(Ce)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Khomyakov A P, Nechelyustov G N, Rastsvetaeva R K, Ma Zhesheng (2003) Diversilite-(Ce), Na&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Ba,K)&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;Ce&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;Ti&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;[Si&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;9&lt;/sub&gt;]&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;[SiO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;OH]&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(OH,H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O)&lt;sub&gt;9&lt;/sub&gt;, a new silicate with heterogeneous tetrahedral complexes from the Khibina alkaline massif, Kola Peninsula, Russia, Zapiski Vserossijskogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 132(5) 34-39</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.CB.10</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
