    <gsmin:fleischersgroup xml:lang="en">zippeite</gsmin:fleischersgroup>
    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Cu&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;[(UO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(SO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;]·12H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imanumber xml:lang="en">IMA2000-019</gsmin:imanumber>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:mindatid>min-26289</gsmin:mindatid>
    <gsmin:mindaturi rdf:resource="https://www.mindat.org/1:1:26289:1"/>
    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-26289.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Cu&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(U&lt;sup&gt;6+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(S&lt;sup&gt;6+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·12H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Pseudojohannite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Pseudojohannite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Ondrus P, Veselovský F, Skála R, Císarová I, Hlousek J, Frýda J, Vavrín I, Cejka J, Gabasová A (1997) New naturally occurring phases of secondary origin from Jáchymov (Joachimsthal). Journal of the Czech Geological Society, 42, 77-107 Chemical formula revised from Cu&lt;sub&gt;6.5&lt;/sub&gt;(UO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;(SO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;5&lt;/sub&gt;·25H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O to Cu&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(UO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(SO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;·12H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O: Plášil J, Fejfarová K, Wallwork K S, Dušek M, Škoda R, Sejkora J, Cejka J, Veselovský F, Hloušek J, Meisser N, Brugger J (2012) Crystal structure of pseudojohannite, with a revised formula, Cu&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;[(UO&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(SO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;](H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O)&lt;sub&gt;12&lt;/sub&gt;, American Mineralogist 97, 1796-1803</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>0</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:webmineralurl>http://www.webmineral.com/data/Pseudojohannite.shtml</gsmin:webmineralurl>
    <gsmin:wikipediadate>0</gsmin:wikipediadate>
  </rdf:Description>
