    <gsmin:chemistryelements>Ce | Nd | La | Fe | Ti | Al | O | Si | As | H</gsmin:chemistryelements>
    <gsmin:crystalsystem xml:lang="en">hexagonal</gsmin:crystalsystem>
    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">(Ce,Nd,La)(Fe&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;,Ti,Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;,Al)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;1-x+y&lt;/sub&gt;(AsO&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;1+x-y&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;3x-3y&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imanumber xml:lang="en">IMA1986-044</gsmin:imanumber>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">(Ce&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;,Nd&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;,La&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;)(Fe&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;,Ti&lt;sup&gt;4+&lt;/sup&gt;,Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;,Al)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;0.8&lt;/sub&gt;(As&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;1.2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;0.6&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffids>R110070</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Cervandonite-(Ce)</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Cervandonite-(Ce)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Armbruster T, Bühler C, Graeser S, Stalder H A, Amthauer G (1988) Cervandonite-(Ce), (Ce,Nd,La)(Fe&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;,Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;,Ti&lt;sup&gt;4+&lt;/sup&gt;,Al)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;SiAs(Si,As)O&lt;sub&gt;13&lt;/sub&gt;, a new alpine fissure mineral, Schweizerische Mineralogische und Petrographische Mitteilungen 68, 125-132 Chemical formula revised: Demartin F, Gramaccioli C M, Graeser S (2008) The crystal structure of cervandonite-(Ce), an interesting example of As&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;-Si diadochy, The Canadian Mineralogist 46, 423-430</gsmin:statusnotes>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/fermiite">
