    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">RDF/OWL representation of the 2014-10 edition of the International Chronostratigraphic Chart from the International Commission on Stratigraphy. Encoded using OWL implementation from GSO. Adapted from Cox&amp;Richard OWL GeologicTime ontology</rdfs:comment>
