    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Chesnokov B V, Bazhenova L F (1985) Srebrodolskite Ca2Fe2O5—a new mineral, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 114, issue 2, 195-199</gsmin:statusnotes>
