    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Original name incorrectly referred to ferrimolybdite: Schaller W T (1907) The chemical composition of molybdic ocher, American Journal of Science 23, 297-303 Name is resurrected for a newly discovered mineral with the intended properties of the original: Cech F, Mandarino J A, Fleischer M, Hildebrand F A (1964) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 49, 1497-1502</gsmin:statusnotes>
