    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Moëlo Y, Orlandi P, Guillot-Deudon C, Biagioni C, Paar W, Evain M (2011) Lead-antimony sulfosalts from Tuscany (Italy). XI. The new mineral species parasterryite, Ag_4_Pb_20_(Sb_14.5_As_9.5_)_S24_S_58_, and associated sterryite, Cu(Ag,Cu)_3_Pb_19_(Sb,As)_22_(As-As)S_56_, from the Pollone mine, Tuscany, Italy, The Canadian Mineralogist 49, 623-638</gsmin:statusnotes>
