    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">The mineral was reported, but not named in this publication: Svanberg A F, Tenger C (1838) Mineralogi, Årsberättelse Om Framstegen I Fysik och Kemi 16, 200-208 The mineral was named: Dana J D, Brush G J (1868) 745. Tengerite, in A System of Mineralogy, Fifth Edition, John Wiley and Sons (New York) 710-710 Name changed from tengerite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042</gsmin:statusnotes>
