    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Robert J L, Maury R C (1979) Natural occurrence of a (Fe,Mn,Mg) tetrasilicic potassium mica, Contributions to Mineralogy and Petrology 68, 117-123 Redefined: Rieder M, Cavazzini G, D’Yakonov Y S, Frank-Kamenetskii V A, Gottardt G, Guggenheim S, Koval P V, Muller G, Neiva A M R, Radoslovich E W, Robert J L, Sassi F P, Takeda H, Weiss Z, Wones D R (1998) Nomenclature of the micas, The Canadian Mineralogist 36, 905-912</gsmin:statusnotes>
