  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/common/Proportion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A quality denoting the fraction that a part composes a whole. Numeric values will range from 0 to 1 (0 to 100%); might also have categorical determinates like 'dominant', 'subordinate', 'minor', 'rare', 'absent'. Can only be the quality of a part role - only specifies how much a part makes up a whole.</rdfs:comment>
