    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Giester G, Lengauer C L, Pristacz H, Rieck B, Topa D, Von Bezing KL (2016) Cairncrossite, a new Ca-Sr (-Na) phyllosilicate from the Wessels Mine, Kalahari Manganese Field, South Africa. European Journal of Mineralogy 28, 495-505</gsmin:statusnotes>
