    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Y&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;Al(SiO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(OH)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;F&lt;sub&gt;5&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Kuliokite-(Y)</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Kuliokite-(Y)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Voloshin A V, Pakhomovsky Y A, Tyusheva F N, Sokolova Y V, Egorov-Tismenko Y K (1986) Kuliokite-(Y) - A new yttrium-aluminium fluoride-silicate from amazonite pegmatites of the Kola Peninsula, Mineralogiceskij Zhurnal 8, 94-99</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.AG.50</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
