    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Tornebohmite-(La)</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Sviajin N V (1962) Tornebohmite from the alkaline province of Ural, Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 91, 97-99 Name changed from tornebohmite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042</gsmin:statusnotes>
