    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Nagashima M, Nishio-Hamane D, Tomita N, Minakawa T, Inaba S (2015) Ferriakasakaite-(La) and ferriandrosite-(La): new epidote-supergroup minerals from Ise, Mie Prefecture, Japan. Mineralogical Magazine 79, 735-753</gsmin:statusnotes>
