    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Segelerite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Moore P B, Ito J (1974) I. Jahnsite, segelerite, and robertsite, three new transition metal phosphate species II. Redefinition of overite, an isotype of segelerite III. Isotypy of robertsite, mitridatite, and arseniosiderite, American Mineralogist 59, 48-59</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Overite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
