    <dct:source>Fleuty (1964) Folds classification.</dct:source>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Surface dips between 0 and 10 degrees; typically used to describe orientation of fold hing surface or axial surface, use equivalent term 'Horizontal inclination' for other geologic surfaces.</rdfs:comment>
