    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Known previous to obtaining a formal mineral name: Rome de l'Isle J B L (1783) Nitre à base calcaire, in Cristallographie, ou Description des Formes a Tous les Corps du Regne Minéral, Volume 1, (Paris) 360-361 Mineral was named in this publication: Shepard C U (1835) Nitrocalcite. Calcareous earthy-salt, in Treatise on Mineralogy: Second Part, Volume II, Hezekiah Howe &amp; Co. (New Haven) 84-85</gsmin:statusnotes>
