  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/elbrusite">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Elbrusite</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geology/Mineral_Material"/>
    <gsmin:chemistryelements>Ca | Zr | U | Fe | O</gsmin:chemistryelements>
    <gsmin:crystalsystem xml:lang="en">cubic</gsmin:crystalsystem>
    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Ca&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(U&lt;sup&gt;6+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;0.5&lt;/sub&gt;Zr&lt;sub&gt;1.5&lt;/sub&gt;)(Fe&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imanumber xml:lang="en">IMA2009-051</gsmin:imanumber>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved|Renamed</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Ca&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;(Zr&lt;sup&gt;4+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1.5&lt;/sub&gt;U&lt;sup&gt;6+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;0.5&lt;/sub&gt;)Fe&lt;sup&gt;3+&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;12&lt;/sub&gt;</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Elbrusite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Elbrusite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Galuskina I O, Galuskin E V, Armbruster T, Lazic B, Kusz J, Dzierzanowski P, Gazeev V M, Pertsev N N, Prusik K, Zadov A E, Winiarski A, Wrzalik R, Gurbanov A G (2010) Elbrusite-(Zr) - A new uranian garnet from the Upper Chegem caldera, Kabardino-Balkaria, Northern Caucasus, Russia, American Mineralogist 95, 1172-1181 Name changed from elbrusite-(Zr) and formula changed from Ca_3_U^6+^ZrFe^3+^_2_Fe^2+^O_12_: Grew E S, Locock A J, Mills S J, Galuskina I O, Galuskin E V, Hålenius U (2013) Nomenclature of the garnet supergroup. American Mineralogist 98, 785-811</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Garnet</gsmin:structuralgroup>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/arangasite">
