    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Rose G (1842) 38. Tschewkinit, Mineralogisch-Geognostische Reise nach dem Ural, dem Altai und dem Kaspischen Meere 2, 513-514 Name changed from chevkinite: Nickel E H, Mandarino J A (1987) Procedures involving the IMA Commission on New Minerals and Mineral Names and guidelines on mineral nomenclature, American Mineralogist 72, 1031-1042</gsmin:statusnotes>
