    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Miyawaki R, Yokoyama K, Matsubara S, Tsutsumi Y, Goto A (2008) Uedaite-(Ce), a new member of the epidote group with Mn at the A site, from Shodoshima, Kagawa Prefecture, Japan, European Journal of Mineralogy 20, 261-269</gsmin:statusnotes>
