    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Yafsoanite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Yafsoanite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Kim A A, Zayakina N V, Lavrent'yev Y G (1982) Yafsoanite, (Zn&lt;sub&gt;1.38&lt;/sub&gt;Ca&lt;sub&gt;1.36&lt;/sub&gt;Pb&lt;sub&gt;0.26&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;TeO&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;, a new tellurium mineral. Zapiski Vsesoyuznogo Mineralogicheskogo Obshchestva 111(1), 118-121 Chemical formula modified: Jarosch D, Zemann J (1989) Yafsoanite: a garnet type calcium-tellurium(VI)-zinc oxide, Mineralogy and Petrology 40, 111-116</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Garnet</gsmin:structuralgroup>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>04.CC.25</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">Oxide, Metal: Oxygen = 2: 3,3: 5, and similar, With large and medium-sized cations</gsmin:strunzlabel>
