    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Siidra O I, Chukanov N V, Yapaskurt V O, Belakovskiy D I, Murashko M N, Sidorov E G (2014) Kaliochalcite, KCu_2_(SO_4_)_2_[(OH)(H_2_O)], a new tsumcorite-group mineral from the Tolbachik volcano, Kamchatka, Russia. European Journal of Mineralogy 26, 597-604</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:structuralgroup xml:lang="en">Natrochalcite</gsmin:structuralgroup>
  </rdf:Description>
