    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Burckhardtite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Gaines R V, Leavens P B, Nelen J A (1979) Burckhardtite, a new silicate-tellurite from Mexico, American Mineralogist 64, 355-358 Chemical formula revised from Pb_2_Fe^3+^Te^4+^(Si_3_Al)O_12_(OH)_2_·H_2_O: Christy A G, Kampf A R, Mills S J, Housley R M, Thorne B (2014) Crystal structure and revised chemical formula for burckhardtite, Pb_2_(Fe^3+^Te^6+^)[AlSi_3_O_8_]O_6_: a double-sheet silicate with intercalated phyllotellurate layers. Mineralogical Magazine 78, 1763-1773</gsmin:statusnotes>
