    <gsmin:mindaturl>http://www.mindat.org/min-4007.html</gsmin:mindaturl>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Ba&lt;sub&gt;21&lt;/sub&gt;Ca(Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;,Mn&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;,Ti&lt;sup&gt;4+&lt;/sup&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;(Ti&lt;sup&gt;4+&lt;/sup&gt;,Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;,Mg)&lt;sub&gt;12&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;12&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;36&lt;/sub&gt;)(Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;(O,OH)&lt;sub&gt;30&lt;/sub&gt;Cl&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;·14H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffids>R060706</gsmin:rruffids>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Traskite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Traskite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Alfors J T, Stinson M C, Matthews R A, Pabst A (1965) Seven new barium minerals from eastern Fresno County, California, American Mineralogist 50, 314-340 Chemical formula revised: Alfors J T, Putman G W (1965) Revised chemical analyses of traskite, verplanckite and muirite from Fresno County, California, American Mineralogist 50, 1500-1503 Chemical formula revised again: Malinovskii Yu A, Pobedimskaya E A, Belov N V (1976) Crystal structure of traskite, Soviet Physics - Doklady 21, 426-428</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>09.CP.05</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
