    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Bosi F, Reznitskii L, Skogby H, Hålenius U (2014) Vanadio-oxy-chromium-dravite, NaV_3_(Cr_4_Mg_2_)(Si_6_O_18_)(BO_3_)_3_(OH)_3_O, a new mineral species of the tourmaline supergroup. American Mineralogist 99, 1155-1162</gsmin:statusnotes>
