    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Hålenius U, Bosi F (2013) Oxyplumboroméite, Pb_2_Sb_2_O_7_, a new mineral species of the pyrochlore supergroup from Harstigen mine, Värmland, Sweden. Mineralogical Magazine 77, 2931-2939</gsmin:statusnotes>
