    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Orlandi P, Meerschaut A, Moelo Y, Palvadeau P, Leone P (2005) Lead-antimony sulfosalts from Tuscany (Italy). VIII. Rouxelite, Cu_2_HgPb_22_Sb_28_S_64_(O,S)_2_, a new sulfosalt from Buca della Vena mine, Apuan Alps: definition and crystal structure, The Canadian Mineralogist 43, 919-933</gsmin:statusnotes>
