    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Vignola P, Hatert F, Bersani D, Diella V, Gentile P, Risplendente A (2012) Chukhrovite-(Ca), Ca&lt;sub&gt;4.5&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(SO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)F&lt;sub&gt;13&lt;/sub&gt;·12H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, a new mineral species from the Val Cavallizza Pb-Zn-(Ag) mine, Cuasso al Monte, Varese province, Italy, European Journal of Mineralogy 24, 1069-1076</gsmin:statusnotes>
