    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Ambrinoite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Ambrinoite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Biagioni C, Bonaccorsi E, Pasero M, Moëlo Y, Ciriotti M E, Bersani D, Callegari A M, Boiocchi M (2011) Ambrinoite, (K,NH&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;(As,Sb)&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;S&lt;sub&gt;13&lt;/sub&gt;·H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O, a new mineral from Upper Susa Valley, Piedmont, Italy: The first natural (K,NH4)-hydrated sulfosalt, American Mineralogist 96, 878-887</gsmin:statusnotes>
    <gsmin:strunzcodeV10>02.HE.10</gsmin:strunzcodeV10>
    <gsmin:strunzlabel xml:lang="en">SnS type sulfosalt with alkalies, H2O</gsmin:strunzlabel>
