    <dct:source xml:lang="en">GeoSciML v2 RC1 model element scope note</dct:source>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Granular material consisting of preserved or replaced remains (casts) of plants or animals. Use gsoc:isProducedFrom to link to taxonomic classification of the fossilized organism.  Other qualities could provide a paleontologic description of the fossil or fossils present.</rdfs:comment>
