  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geologicfoliation/flaser_structure">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Tectonic foliation defined by lenses and layers of original or relatively unaltered granular minerals surrounded by a matrix of highly sheared and crushed material. No connotation of metamorphic grade.</rdfs:comment>
