    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Škoda R, Cempírek J, Filip J, Novák M, Veselovský F, Ctvrtlík R (2012) Allanite-(Nd), CaNdAl&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;Fe&lt;sup&gt;2+&lt;/sup&gt;(SiO&lt;sub&gt;4&lt;/sub&gt;)(Si&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;)O(OH), a new mineral from Åskagen, Sweden, American Mineralogist 97, 983-988</gsmin:statusnotes>
