    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Bernarlottiite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Orlandi P, Biagioni C, Bonaccorsi E, Moëlo Y, Paar W H (2017) Lead-antimony sulfosalts from Tuscany (Italy). XXI. Bernarlottiite, Pb_12_(As_10_Sb_6_)_S16_S_36_, a new &lt;i&gt;N&lt;/i&gt; = 3.5 member of the sartorite homologous series from the Ceragiola marble quarry: occurrence and crystal structure. European Journal of Mineralogy 29, 713-726</gsmin:statusnotes>
  </rdf:Description>
