    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov, I.V., Zubkova, N.V., Agakhanov, A.A., Pautov, L.A., Vigasina, M. F., Sidorov, E.G., Ksenofontov, D.A., Britvin, S.N. and Pushcharovsky, D.Y. (2016) Edtollite, IMA 2016-010. CNMNC Newsletter No. 31, June 2016, page 696; Mineralogical Magazine, 80, 691–697.</gsmin:statusnotes>
