    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Cesiodymite</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Cesiodymite</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Pekov I V, Zubkova N V, Agakhanov A A, Pushcharovsky D Y, Yapaskurt V O, Belakovskiy D I, Vigasina M F, Sidorov E G, Britvin S N (2018) Cryptochalcite, K_2_Cu_5_O(SO_4_)_5_, and cesiodymite, CsKCu_5_O(SO_4_)_5_, two new isotypic minerals and the K-Cs isomorphism in this solid-solution series. European Journal of Mineralogy 30, 593-607</gsmin:statusnotes>
