  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/mineral/mazzite-mg">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Mazzite-Mg</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geology/Mineral_Material"/>
    <gsmin:chemistryelements>Mg | Si | Al | O | H</gsmin:chemistryelements>
    <gsmin:crystalsystem xml:lang="en">hexagonal</gsmin:crystalsystem>
    <gsmin:fleischersgroup xml:lang="en">zeolite-mazzite series</gsmin:fleischersgroup>
    <gsmin:imachemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Mg&lt;sub&gt;5&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;26&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;10&lt;/sub&gt;)O&lt;sub&gt;72&lt;/sub&gt;·30H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:imachemistry>
    <gsmin:imanumber xml:lang="en">IMA1973-045</gsmin:imanumber>
    <gsmin:imastatus xml:lang="en">Approved</gsmin:imastatus>
    <gsmin:rruffchemistry rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Mg&lt;sub&gt;5&lt;/sub&gt;(Si&lt;sub&gt;26&lt;/sub&gt;Al&lt;sub&gt;10&lt;/sub&gt;)O&lt;sub&gt;72&lt;/sub&gt;·30H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O</gsmin:rruffchemistry>
    <gsmin:rruffnamehtml rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Mazzite-Mg</gsmin:rruffnamehtml>
    <gsmin:rruffnameplain xml:lang="en">Mazzite-Mg</gsmin:rruffnameplain>
    <gsmin:statusnotes xml:lang="en">Galli E, Passaglia E, Pongiluppi D, Rinaldi R (1974) Mazzite, a new mineral, the natural counterpart of the synthetic zeolite O, Contributions to Mineralogy and Petrology 45, 99-105 Fleischer M (1975) New mineral names, American Mineralogist 60, 340-341 Name changed from mazzite, chemical formula revised: Arletti R, Galli E, Vezzalini G, Wise W S (2005) Mazzite-Na, a new zeolite from Boron, California: its description and crystal structure, American Mineralogist 90, 1186-1191</gsmin:statusnotes>
  </rdf:Description>
