    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Granular material consisting of spherulitic clusters of crystals in a mafic rock, usually consisting of divergent plagioclase fibers, with or without interstitial glass, or intergrown with granules of pyroxene, olivine or iron ore. (equivalent to Spherule, but in mafic rock)</rdfs:comment>
