  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/geologicfoliation/bedding_lamination_structure">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A surface internal to the containing sediment mass defined by textural or mineralogical variation, produced by sediment deposition process, and reflecting the orientation of the original depositional surface. Syn Laminated structure (NADM sedimentary rock vocabulary (https://pubs.usgs.gov/of/2004/1451/sltt/appendixC/appendixC_pdf.zip)  SLTTs 2004).</rdfs:comment>
