    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en-us">gram per cubic centimeter</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">0,001-fold of the SI base unit kilogram divided by the 0.000 001-fold of the power of the SI base unit metre with the exponent 3. Abbreviation g.cm-3</skos:definition>
