    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dislocated part of a thing, collected for some reason. Some samples are also examples of their whole (i.e. are prototypical) and others are not.</rdfs:comment>
